 below.","2026-01-15T09:53:51.847Z"],["3811801","L10N-27920","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27899](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27899)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T09:53:56.255Z"],["3811802","L10N-27929","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27899](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27899)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T09:54:00.435Z"],["3811803","L10N-27928","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27899](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27899)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T09:54:01.108Z"],["3811804","L10N-27932","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27899](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27899)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T09:54:02.204Z"],["3811805","L10N-27934","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27899](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27899)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T09:54:03.661Z"],["3811807","WD-22550","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","Hi ! I updated intercompany profile of BG002, additionally I linked BG002 with Supplier “Bolt Support Services BG EOOD” and Customer “Bolt Support Services BG EOOD” and made default currency for supplier and customer EUR \n\n\n\nSo now [~accountid:712020:2261816b-1a2b-4b75-b1dc-d5fce431ad15] you should be able to create customer invoice from BG002 to EE003 ","2026-01-15T09:54:38.250Z"],["3811809","PFI-833449","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! Please provide more details:\n1. Which payout?\n2. For what order(s)\n3. What is the expected amount and why? \n4. Based on what are you saying it’s incorrect? ","2026-01-15T09:55:03.906Z"],["3811812","PFI-833672","PFI","rouz.aydamirova@bolt.eu","Rouz Aydamirova","!WhatsApp Image 2026-01-15 at 13.17.22.jpeg|thumbnail!","2026-01-15T09:55:15.547Z"],["3811813","LSS-61533","LSS","alon.alkalay@bolt.eu","Alon Alkalay","Hey [~accountid:712020:b2a2738f-c1f1-447c-9b72-29851b5fed3e] thank you. Was this auto assigned to you or created by a stakeholder and sent to you? Just so I know whether there is a service desk automation issue. \n\nWe don’t currently have a standard background check consent. Usually these are performed by 3rd parties and the candidate provides consent to the 3rd part themselves (as an independent controller). \n\nI’m fine with the consent you drafted. But let’s just double check which 3rd parry will be performing the background check and whether we will be transferring data to the 3rd party (may require a DSA if we don’t have one already), or whether we will direct the candidate to them like we do in some other markets. \n\nThanks. ","2026-01-15T09:55:16.795Z"],["3811816","TAXP-684","TAXP","celia.kuria@bolt.eu","Celia Kuria-Kwach","Yes accurate. It is a late start date mainly due to TP forms that are filed as part of CIT which tend to be ready from about November","2026-01-15T09:56:22.782Z"],["3811818","HS-28913","HS","kerilin.mand@bolt.eu","Kerilin Mänd","Hi [~accountid:5fedbf726420890141c7ea53],\n\nPergamin updated their platform and the error might have been due to this. Can you please try again? Let me know if you were unsuccessful and I will contact them again.  \n\nBest regards,\n\nKerilin","2026-01-15T09:56:36.767Z"],["3811819","WDFT-3529","WDFT","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","[~accountid:623c7881562ab90069f8f044] ,\n\nI’ll try see if there were changes to the way the transaction works. \n\nBut probably, I should have asked you before … how the assets will be transferred legally : is it going to be legally arranged as sale of assets between the companies?  Or other way? ","2026-01-15T09:57:01.489Z"],["3811823","WFM-9996","WFM","malgorzata.kolosinska@bolt.eu","Małgorzata Kołosińska","Ana can you tell me what queues they are working on? or share an example of agent with designated access please","2026-01-15T09:57:22.135Z"],["3811826","LSS-58510","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","[~accountid:712020:0b391d02-6c8a-4494-99fd-3d2ff0d7ef37] , Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^Załącznik nr 1 Oświadczenie Dostawcy_Bolt Business_01.2026.pdf] [^Załącznik nr 2 Oświadczenie o rachunku bankowym Dostawcy_Bolt Business_01.2026.pdf] [^Załącznik nr 3 Kodeks Etyki Handlowej (4) (61681015-7927-432e-8152-71ff318f7f16).pdf] ","2026-01-15T09:57:51.860Z"],["3811827","LSS-61533","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","Hey [~accountid:712020:0b1ccfcb-3809-460a-88ab-c96985ba329a] - this was escalated to me by a stakeholder, not auto-assigned.\n\nThanks for clarifying re/ third parties - I was not aware of this.","2026-01-15T09:58:11.154Z"],["3811829","LSS-61499","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:0b391d02-6c8a-4494-99fd-3d2ff0d7ef37] ! The document will be signed today, sorry for delay","2026-01-15T09:58:55.904Z"],["3811830","PAW-14906","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 AI Analysis: Component label added automatically.\n\nIf you think the component label is incorrect, please remove the suggested label and add the correct one.If you was assigned to this issue, unassign yourself and add the correct label.\n\n","2026-01-15T09:59:10.226Z"],["3811831","LSS-61499","LSS","tomasz.symonowicz@bolt.eu","Tomasz Symonowicz","thank you","2026-01-15T09:59:15.952Z"],["3811832","LSS-61598","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hey! Please find the signed document attached. We didn’t add a date at the top like previously, hopefully that’s okay still.\n\n[^Sole director's resolutions - Bolt Operations UK Limited - resignation of Nick Walker_15.01.26.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T09:59:35.605Z"],["3811833","DSR-2555","DSR","oliver.chinyere@bolt.eu","Oliver Chinyere","[~accountid:712020:d4fea1a1-04d3-411a-82fc-435abbd538e3] I attempted to submit this DSAR today (15 January 2026) but received a bounce-back can you kindly confirm the employee’s email? \n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-15 at 10.02.22 AM.png|width=710,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-15 at 10.02.22 AM.png\"!\n\n ","2026-01-15T09:59:45.602Z"],["3811834","LSS-61533","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","Hi [~accountid:712020:233a6d49-7634-40c9-bf6d-95ce9d2980e0] - could you clarify for the privacy team whether a third party will conduct the background check and if we will transfer any personal data to them?\n\nIf so, please specify the provider and whether we have signed a data sharing or data processing agreement with them, if you know.","2026-01-15T09:59:55.466Z"],["3811835","PFI-833657","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThis is very unfortunate. \n\nThe user has a negative balance of 52.60 GBP and 9.50 PLN. \n\nThe negative balance of 52.60 GBP was created from this payment as the user had insufficient funds. \n[https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/1326496435|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/1326496435]\n[https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/425545969/25|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/425545969/25]\n\nThe negative balance of 9.50 PLN was created from this order as the payment could not be created. \n[https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/1106511085/307?orderTryId=1225384622|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/1106511085/307?orderTryId=1225384622]\n\nPlease note that the users Bolt balances are related to their current location. If the user is in an EUR denominated country they will only be able to see their EUR balance. \n\nThere is no convenient way for the user to top up their balance in another currency. We generally don’t expect the user to top up their balance in a foreign currency. \n\n\nIf the user would like to see their GBP and the PLN balance then they can either: \n\n* Physically travel to countries where GBP and PLN are accepted. \n* Spoof their devices GPS location to the UK and Poland. This would allow the user to see the GBP and PLN balances. This is generally not advised as the user might have to get an external app to do it. \n\n\nThere is also an option to check with the fraud team as they might be able to whitelist the user which would allow them to rent a car even with a negative balance. \nHowever, since the negative balance amount is quite substantial I think the fraud team might be reluctant to do this. \n\nPlease let me know if you have any questions. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-15T10:01:10.044Z"],["3811836","LSS-61003","LSS","mael.heinrich@bolt.eu","Maël Heinrich","Hi [~accountid:712020:b3dbddb5-16a8-4ad6-9138-80fbe6e695a9] ! FO came back several times asking for the money to be transfered, but he did not provide proof of re-registration. Payouts are disabled waiting for him to provide necessary proof. In that case, we will reply here or open another ticket for approval. You can safely close this ticket. Thank you! 🙏 ","2026-01-15T10:01:30.000Z"],["3811842","FX-3217","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Pema Couto Matos [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1768471337916529]*{color}:\n<@U09D62DKH9P> seems like the company names are displayed correctly in FP and Beehive, thanks for all the work done here, it is very much appreciated :pray:\n{quote}","2026-01-15T10:03:00.297Z"],["3811843","LSS-61368","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi, please find the signed document attached.\n\n[^Addendum to Service Agreement - Name Change - Slough_Bolt Operations UK Limited_IW Group Services (UK) Limited_09.01.26.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:03:01.672Z"],["3811844","LSS-60250","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:6423e317b05b4e3e7dabadb6] ! Are there any updates there?","2026-01-15T10:03:07.617Z"],["3811846","FX-3217","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Chantel Rowe [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1768471385296849]*{color}:\nWe're finishing the work today, I’ll confirm when done \n{quote}","2026-01-15T10:03:21.720Z"],["3811847","PFI-833678","PFI","janis.schiedkova@bolt-outsource.eu","Janis Schiedkova","!Screenshot_20260115-094305_Bolt Driver.png|thumbnail!\n\n!Screenshot_20260115-094400_Bolt Driver.png|thumbnail!\n\n!markup_1000001255.png|thumbnail!\n\n!markup_1000001256.png|thumbnail!\n\n!signal-2026-01-01-16-41-25-171.mp4|thumbnail!\n\n!signal-2026-01-01-20-06-35-885.mp4|thumbnail!","2026-01-15T10:03:26.194Z"],["3811848","WD-22576","WD","lilian.gounden@bolt.eu","Lil Gounden","understood, i will let you know once i have added access, thanks","2026-01-15T10:03:34.587Z"],["3811849","PFI-833678","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-15T10:03:34.890Z"],["3811851","WDFT-3529","WDFT","kristiine.murd@bolt.eu","Kristiine Murd","[~accountid:712020:fa8a842c-b8b9-4555-a3d9-2647acf081ec] legally this is done based on business transfer (part of the In-Kind Contribution Agreement), so no sale of assets\n\n14.01.26: Just one more point - the approach you described is correct to use if we had Asset sale, but in the case (and in 2022/2023) it’s business transfer with asset transfer.","2026-01-15T10:03:46.279Z"],["3811853","TAXP-645","TAXP","celia.kuria@bolt.eu","Celia Kuria-Kwach","There is no tax to pay because of dormancy of company. I have updated due dates to correct initial dates.","2026-01-15T10:04:31.812Z"],["3811854","PAW-14902","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was approved by @daysleeperx\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/160713\nStatus: open\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-15 10:04:43 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-15T10:04:43.934Z"],["3811855","LSS-59374","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:646a712a-8a6c-463c-961f-5109f9d647a0] ! any updates from the Counterparty? Currently still waiting upon signature 🙂","2026-01-15T10:05:04.966Z"],["3811856","PFI-830972","PFI","sheraton.donbosco@bolt.eu","Sheraton Donbosco","Thank you [~accountid:712020:fc661671-1d51-4372-9578-b46465bd51ac]. Will they give an update in this ticket? ","2026-01-15T10:05:05.541Z"],["3811857","LSS-61620","LSS","loredana.panait@bolt.eu","Loredana Panait","[^Extension Service Agreement template company - 2025 new logo.docx] _(109 kB)_","2026-01-15T10:05:17.799Z"],["3811858","CSDA-258","CSDA","mariia.cherezova@bolt.eu","Mariia Cherezova","Hi again!\n\nPlease try the following links:\n\n* [https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/rides/fact_rides_order?qid=q6XKL3UWGEX4u1WJbk4ozq&toggle=fil|https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/rides/fact_rides_order?qid=q6XKL3UWGEX4u1WJbk4ozq&toggle=fil]\n* [https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/curated/fact_rides_order?qid=q6XKL3UWGEX4u1WJbk4ozq&toggle=fil|https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/curated/fact_rides_order?qid=q6XKL3UWGEX4u1WJbk4ozq&toggle=fil]\n\nThese are the same queries from the same explores, but the explores are located in different Looker projects/models. As I can see, you should have access at least to the second explore. But please check and let me know 🙏","2026-01-15T10:05:27.692Z"],["3811860","LSS-60955","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:705c56b5-c931-428e-8282-8c20af89d9c2] ! any updates from the Counterparty? Currently still waiting upon signature 🙂","2026-01-15T10:05:44.343Z"],["3811863","PRIV-485","PRIV","ema.mlynarcikova@bolt.eu","Ema Mlynarcikova","Confluence Draft started here: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020eb9cd4dd46ca47c8a9859f940495724a/pages/7404814392/3P+Grocery+DSA+Playbook|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020eb9cd4dd46ca47c8a9859f940495724a/pages/7404814392/3P+Grocery+DSA+Playbook|smart-link] ","2026-01-15T10:07:46.166Z"],["3811864","LSS-61470","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:6d5640ba-c28b-492d-b071-2c5df1c7e01b] !\n\nPlease find the signed document(s) attached.\n\n[^Bolt teenusleping taksofirmaga Sõidame OÜ.asice (1).asice] ","2026-01-15T10:07:47.516Z"],["3811865","LSS-61368","LSS","khadeza.islam@bolt.eu","Khadeza Islam","Thank you!","2026-01-15T10:08:10.714Z"],["3811868","LSS-59915","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.\n\n[^V2_BOLT_EY_Agreement_EMI Support_docx (1) (1).asice] ","2026-01-15T10:08:49.299Z"],["3811870","LSS-61365","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi, please find the signed document attached.\n\n[^Branding contract - Frankfurt Fleet_Bolt Operations OÜ_Tanveer Ahmed_01.02.26.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:09:11.367Z"],["3811871","DO-5793","DO","volha.anishchanka@bolt.eu","Volha Anishchanka","Should be done, please try with dbt ","2026-01-15T10:09:11.032Z"],["3811873","RDXENG-4661","RDXENG","ankit.goyal@bolt.eu","Ankit Goyal","[@germo.rikk|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/5d5ff31d5a68ef0ca6258fd8] The fix has been deployed. Is it possible for you to verify?","2026-01-15T10:10:00.765Z"],["3811874","LSS-61241","LSS","gabriel.souza@bolt.eu","Gabriel Gonçalo","Hello team! The lawyer returned with the following response: \n\n_Exma. Sra. D. Andrezza,_\n\n_Muito agradeço a informação prestada._\n\n_Entendo perfeitamente a motivação por detrás do bloqueio, no entanto, solicito que seja dada uma última oportunidade ao M/Constituinte._\n\n_Falarei com  o M/Constituinte sobre a importância de dar cumprimento à legislação estradal._\n\n_Aguardo as V/prezadas notícias._\n\n_Com os meus melhores cumprimentos,_\n\nCan we just reinforce the information that the driver will not be unblocked? \n\nThank you! ","2026-01-15T10:10:18.900Z"],["3811875","DAEN-1313","DAEN","kevin.sutanto@bolt.eu","Kevin Sutanto","Some clarifying questions in slack [*here*|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C08QVGBP73R/p1768463661275719]","2026-01-15T10:10:28.017Z"],["3811876","LSS-61478","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hey! No worries at all! This has now been signed. Please find it attached!\n\n[^Warehouse contract - Dresden_Bolt Services DE GmbH_Anton Ewers Beteiligungs - Familien GmbH_15.01.26.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:12:01.664Z"],["3811877","LSS-61123","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:5b7bea7195627d2a5723efff] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.\n\n[^Bolt_ Izjava o partnerskoj suradnji_ TAXI MRVICA j.d.o.o. (1) (1).pdf] ","2026-01-15T10:12:17.886Z"],["3811878","CEBF-1830","CEBF","bophana.ros@bolt.eu","Bophana Ros","*Jan Matějka* [Jan 15, 2026 11:48 AM|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C05RK5Y3HQR/p1768470485725479] in Slack channel [#salesforce-rollout-global|https://slack.com/app_redirect?channel=C05RK5Y3HQR]\n\n{quote}Hello, guys! I've encountered an error with commission scheduling. Our sales rep scheduled <https://boltfood.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Account_Scheduled_Commission__c/a0wTs00000D4iPaIAJ/view?ws=%2Flightning%2Fr%2FAccount%2F001Ts00000SPV8ZIAX%2Fview|commission here{quote}\n\n> , which should be applied on Dec 10th 2025 (25%) and the case shows it as applied. However in admin I've encountered, they're still on trial commission 20 %. I've changed it, but I want to make sure, we don't have an issue here. :thank_you:","2026-01-15T10:12:23.946Z"],["3811880","LSS-61484","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret","{quote}+Info received from mediator 15.01.2026+:\n\nBonjour Madame Huret,\n\nVous trouverez attaché la facture Bolt.\n\nLa demande de monsieur Denys, faisant suite à une série d’échanges avec le chauffeur puis avec Bolt concerne un remboursement d’une partie de la course (cout initial 23€, facturé 61€, erreur de trajets du chauffeur…\n\nBien à Vous{quote}\n\n\n\n[^192401-E569136-Ride-invoice-from-Bolt.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:12:51.561Z"],["3811883","LSS-61141","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:7a9c1391-243a-422e-806d-72d75be13638] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.\n\n[^06.01.26_Proposed agreement Resilient Strategies __ Bolt Services US (06 January 26).docx (1).pdf] ","2026-01-15T10:13:37.920Z"],["3811884","IOTTEAM-219","IOTTEAM","endrik.salak@bolt.eu","Endrik Salak","Proposal to move the DC_IN measurement point to after the input protections to reduce potential burn-down of MCU.\n\n\n!image-20260115-101315.png|width=1055,alt=\"image-20260115-101315.png\"!","2026-01-15T10:13:51.260Z"],["3811885","LSS-61622","LSS","rustem.aidarkhanov@bolt.eu","Rustem Aidarkhanov","[^Дополнительное соглашение Nº1.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:13:59.839Z"],["3811887","LSS-61621","LSS","ramil.maharramov@bolt.eu","Ramil Maharramov","General guidance on the framework of such a template agreement was provided by the Samadov Law and Audit. ","2026-01-15T10:14:16.406Z"],["3811888","LSS-61484","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret","Hi [~accountid:712020:dbc22d70-1983-4414-80b3-27f087787ae4] I hope that you are well !\n\nPlease could you look at the attached invoice and help me understand the facts of this situation? How does a 20min ride estimates at 23€ is then invoiced at 61€ ? Passenger claims errors of route taken by driver. \n\nThank you ! 🙏 \n\n","2026-01-15T10:14:23.922Z"],["3811892","DO-5798","DO","gazandi.cahyadarma@bolt.eu","Gazandi Cahyadarma","Hey [~accountid:712020:42cd3ec0-6d95-49ef-b315-7eec5b274bf8] 👋 \n\nCould you please elaborate which notebook you have the error?\nFor the example, you don’t have access to PII table from this notebook.\n[https://bolt-common.cloud.databricks.com/editor/notebooks/447310865571477?o=3598988355446810#command/5089412238738548|https://bolt-common.cloud.databricks.com/editor/notebooks/447310865571477?o=3598988355446810#command/5089412238738548]\n\nCould you please also elaborate which ticket grant you access to the required Hive metastore tables?\n\nYou need to follow these steps to have additional access to PII data.\n1. Get access to Data Platform Authorisation in admin panel [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/6021087382/Data+Platform+Authorisation#Getting-access|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/6021087382/Data+Platform+Authorisation#Getting-access|smart-link]\n2. Create access request from specific PII table e.g. {{sel_customer_support_pii_spark}}*.*{{support_case_comments_v2}} [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/6021087382/Data+Platform+Authorisation#Creating-a-request|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/6021087382/Data+Platform+Authorisation#Creating-a-request|smart-link] \n3.  Use your personal instance profile from your cluster [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/6021087382/Data+Platform+Authorisation#Databricks|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/6021087382/Data+Platform+Authorisation#Databricks|smart-link] \n","2026-01-15T10:15:08.377Z"],["3811893","LSS-59915","LSS","alex.bucse@bolt.eu","Alex Bucșe","[~accountid:712020:4afbd60d-276d-4d8c-8d4c-5669fd772468] cc","2026-01-15T10:15:53.129Z"],["3811894","LSS-58717","LSS","mauricio.oropeza@bolt.eu","Mauricio Oropeza","Hi [~accountid:712020:209f6e12-e421-4fbf-9a9f-60d100117bab]! We confirmed with the partner that we can sign one agreement for both. Also we have confirmed to be able to track performance for each. \n\nCan you please share the information? I don’t know what are the company details for each (VAT, Address, etc).","2026-01-15T10:15:55.686Z"],["3811895","LSS-61620","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Thanks for your ticket! For the lucky ones with access to Flank-supported channels (#legal-agent-) — why not ask your legal AI assistant first on Slack — Flank might already have the answer.","2026-01-15T10:16:07.669Z"],["3811896","LSS-61621","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Thanks for your ticket! For the lucky ones with access to Flank-supported channels (#legal-agent-) — why not ask your legal AI assistant first on Slack — Flank might already have the answer.","2026-01-15T10:16:07.738Z"],["3811897","SCM-846","SCM","konstantin.karhu@bolt.eu","Konstantin Karhu","De-prioritized due to new urgent tasks related to Poznan terminal incident.\nWIP document: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1gTRmosfg0IWZYdWl650DJvf5EIQrDesUKrolpztdcGg/edit?gid=0#gid=0|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1gTRmosfg0IWZYdWl650DJvf5EIQrDesUKrolpztdcGg/edit?gid=0#gid=0|smart-link] ","2026-01-15T10:16:11.974Z"],["3811898","TAXP-925","TAXP","celia.kuria@bolt.eu","Celia Kuria-Kwach","Completed by accounting team [https://app.slack.com/client/E049H2DT1QQ|https://app.slack.com/client/E049H2DT1QQ]","2026-01-15T10:16:20.077Z"],["3811899","LSS-61573","LSS","beatriz.leiva@bolt.eu","Beatriz Leiva","Hi [~accountid:712020:22f1d9b5-1599-49ef-8ecd-0c67511d3425],\n\nThanks for your quick response.\n\nIndeed, the obligation to upload invoices to that system derives from *Law 25/2013, of 27 December, on the promotion of electronic invoicing and the creation of the accounting register of invoices in the Public Sector*.\n\nSome colleagues at Bolt already have the required certificate installed, and requesting installation for additional employees requires proper justification. At the same time, those colleagues may not be able to support invoice uploads on a regular basis due to their existing workload, except on a very occasional basis.\n\nFor this reason, it would be helpful to understand:\n\n* How often invoices must be submitted\n* The approximate number of invoices involved\n* Who is ultimately responsible for submitting the invoices on behalf of Bolt Business\n\nThis will help us assess the most appropriate setup.\n\nMany thanks!","2026-01-15T10:16:42.212Z"],["3811901","PFI-833004","PFI","alexandra.kopcanova@bolt.eu","Alexandra Kopčanová","Thank you. 🙂 you can close the ticket.","2026-01-15T10:16:54.720Z"],["3811902","WD-22550","WD","yuvraj.chhikara@bolt.eu","Yuvraj Chhikara","Thanks [~accountid:712020:fa8a842c-b8b9-4555-a3d9-2647acf081ec] , is this in sbx also?","2026-01-15T10:16:55.947Z"],["3811903","PFI-833004","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋  Thank you for the response. Looks like this ticket is already resolved. \n\nIf the issue persists, please feel free to reopen your request via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/-1 or reach out through #commerce-support-billing.\n\nCheers\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-15T10:16:58.237Z"],["3811910","WD-22550","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","Yep, I first did it in Sanbox","2026-01-15T10:17:42.587Z"],["3811911","LSS-61622","LSS","anna.kalabska@bolt.eu","Anna Kalabska","[~accountid:712020:523b0039-eb47-4ccc-aca3-88d82c0c880a] hey, can you please send me the main contract too?\n\nAlso, was this approved by the real estate team? Thanks!\n\ncc [~accountid:613a01a1e2a0d60069d29ca1] ","2026-01-15T10:17:45.776Z"],["3811912","LSS-61082","LSS","sasha.dornan@bolt.eu","Sasha Dornan","*Attached:* existing Voi lease.\n\n[^2025-11-26_Completed Lease - Unit 9 Phoenix Park (Tenant)(35214714.1) (5680a5c0-2d38-4db5-ab0b-193a4cc1eff5).pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:18:04.417Z"],["3811913","WDFT-3529","WDFT","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","[~accountid:623c7881562ab90069f8f044] , Can you share an agreement (any other legal) document based on which the assets/ deferred cost/ payables? will be transferred? \n\nI also investigation why the system now nets Historical cost and accumulated depreciation for intercom transferes?  … The settings for whole Bolt group were changed ( don’t know when and why)… now any transfer is netted ( which makes sense, because majority of operations between companies are sales) … But good news - we can change the setting for this particular transactions)) and after it is done , we will just return overall Group settings. …. here is another test  now asset is transferred with Historical cost and Accumulated depreciation \n\n\n\n!image-20260115-101659.png|width=1028,alt=\"image-20260115-101659.png\"!","2026-01-15T10:18:08.221Z"],["3811915","TAXP-674","TAXP","celia.kuria@bolt.eu","Celia Kuria-Kwach","Done [https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1Q2X5Fra-xT8Xqdg_5Kfxee1eNZ0-69Em|https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1Q2X5Fra-xT8Xqdg_5Kfxee1eNZ0-69Em|smart-link] ","2026-01-15T10:18:26.687Z"],["3811917","LSS-61123","LSS","sabina@bolt.eu","Sabina Kljenak","Hi, what about the first company inquiry above? 🙂 I submitted request for VELIKI IGRAČ then added TAXI MRVICA since they also needed the statement.","2026-01-15T10:19:13.867Z"],["3811918","PFI-833679","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nI can confirm the refund was issued for EUR 12.41 on Dec 23, 2025, 11:15:41 GMT+2\t\n\nYou can provide the customer the refund reference 15265675357002165963085  to locate the payment. \n\nIf the user still claims non-receipt then please ask them to provide their bank statement as proof. It should be dated from 22nd of December until present. Please make sure the account details, account name and bank name/logo are visible. \n\nOnce received the customer payments team would be able to investigate further. \n\nCheers,\nMarten","2026-01-15T10:19:47.915Z"],["3811920","PFI-833679","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","[^Refund_Letter_MHBW67BPNZVMVNZ3_N5HJ32VDV33P7HG3.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-15T10:20:05.874Z"],["3811922","TAXP-927","TAXP","celia.kuria@bolt.eu","Celia Kuria-Kwach","On hold ","2026-01-15T10:20:08.362Z"],["3811923","LSS-60282","LSS","emelie.dufva@bolt.eu","Emelie Dufva","Hi [~accountid:712020:67606a59-d726-4e53-8ba7-862b9e82da34] can you please confirm that you did not submit this tender and that we will not appeal it? Thanks!","2026-01-15T10:20:15.462Z"],["3811924","LSS-61299","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:b971e044-987e-4f04-8fbe-2c3b651e5a0f] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^Katarzyna Karwan PEL Bolt Poland (1).pdf] ","2026-01-15T10:20:21.472Z"],["3811926","LSS-61146","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","hi [~accountid:618b80b7785cb2006aff7ccd]  following our conversation in slack I’m copying here the reply: \n\n* Please find summary of the review of both suppliers [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1038zGlhWv8equzNhQygSJeqjweXqeV3T4O4Rb4ns1UU/edit?tab=t.0|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1038zGlhWv8equzNhQygSJeqjweXqeV3T4O4Rb4ns1UU/edit?tab=t.0|smart-link] \n* We need to get infosec assessment of both suppliers due to business sensitivity of the data. After this I offer to schedule a call for us to discuss the suppliers\n* In Slack we shared with infosec certification reports of suppliers.  ","2026-01-15T10:20:53.182Z"],["3811928","PFI-833672","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThe customer payments team is unfortunately not able to assist with pricing, discount or promo code related questions. \nPricing is decided by the vertical and the customer payments team does not have any impact on it. \nCould you please raise a ticket with the verticals technical support team instead. \n[https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2]\n\n\nCheers,\nMarten","2026-01-15T10:21:02.534Z"],["3811929","LSS-59750","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","hi [~accountid:618b80b7785cb2006aff7ccd] following our conversation in slack I’m copying here the reply: \n\n* Please find summary of the review of both suppliers [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1038zGlhWv8equzNhQygSJeqjweXqeV3T4O4Rb4ns1UU/edit?tab=t.0|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1038zGlhWv8equzNhQygSJeqjweXqeV3T4O4Rb4ns1UU/edit?tab=t.0|smart-link] \n* We need to get infosec assessment of both suppliers due to business sensitivity of the data. After this I offer to schedule a call for us to discuss the suppliers\n* In Slack we shared with infosec certification reports of suppliers.  ","2026-01-15T10:21:22.188Z"],["3811933","LSS-61428","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:240e5e60-baab-4e72-a388-591f4f4ec6a2] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^AA South Africa - Notice of Termination of Contract  (1).pdf] ","2026-01-15T10:22:08.654Z"],["3811935","LSS-61343","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:610279973900e60070a3495c] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^RFI_21_uk (1).pdf] ","2026-01-15T10:22:54.831Z"],["3811937","LSS-61478","LSS","anouar.miled@bolt.eu","Anouar Miled","Thx [~accountid:622f787a1f014e0069cc0d85] !","2026-01-15T10:23:25.638Z"],["3811940","L10N-27938","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27936](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27936)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T10:23:46.181Z"],["3811941","PFI-833668","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Manually captured in Fondy portal. Asking for a double approval. \n[https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/servicedesk/projects/PFI/queues/custom/379/PFI-833668|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/servicedesk/projects/PFI/queues/custom/379/PFI-833668]","2026-01-15T10:23:47.435Z"],["3811942","LSS-61622","LSS","rustem.aidarkhanov@bolt.eu","Rustem Aidarkhanov","[~accountid:62b1c880566f3e7b0a8f2eb7] Hey! [https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WStYa3OQPy9rBwp58WsUy4FnCK9vvc-1/view|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WStYa3OQPy9rBwp58WsUy4FnCK9vvc-1/view|smart-link] \n\nI informed all stakeholders regarding VAT increase in KZ. The cost for suppliers' services didn’t change though","2026-01-15T10:23:49.030Z"],["3811943","L10N-27947","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keepi