             |   └─Limit_25\nestRows        | 20.00\nactRows        | 1\ntask           | cop[tikv]\naccess object  |\nexecution info | tikv_task:{proc max:910ms, min:0s, avg: 635ms, p80:900ms, p95:910ms, iters:4121, tasks:6}, scan_detail: {total_process_keys: 4196499, total_process_keys_size: 339915108, total_keys: 4201395, get_snapshot_time: 4.3ms, rocksdb: {delete_skipped_count: 14, key_skipped_count: 4200294, block: {cache_hit_count: 2785, read_count: 9364, read_byte: 68.8 MB, read_time: 311.1ms}}}, time_detail: {total_process_time: 3.81s, total_suspend_time: 8.93ms, total_wait_time: 4.41ms, total_kv_read_wall_time: 2.98s, tikv_wall_time: 3.83s}\noperator info  | offset:0, count:20\nmemory         | N/A\ndisk           | N/A\n***************************[ 4. row ]***************************\nid             |     └─Selection_24\nestRows        | 20.00\nactRows        | 1\ntask           | cop[tikv]\naccess object  |\nexecution info | tikv_task:{proc max:910ms, min:0s, avg: 635ms, p80:900ms, p95:910ms, iters:4121, tasks:6}\noperator info  | in(taxify_gdpr_data_deletion.data_deletion.status, \"gather_configuration_failed\", \"manual_deletion_failed\", \"automated_deletion_failed\")\nmemory         | N/A\ndisk           | N/A\n***************************[ 5. row ]***************************\nid             |       └─TableFullScan_23\nestRows        | 690.98\nactRows        | 4196499\ntask           | cop[tikv]\naccess object  | table:data_deletion\nexecution info | tikv_task:{proc max:710ms, min:0s, avg: 496.7ms, p80:680ms, p95:710ms, iters:4121, tasks:6}\noperator info  | keep order:true\nmemory         | N/A\ndisk           | N/A\n5 rows in set\nTime: 0.923s\n\n\nVS\n\n\nroot@ti-user-dba.sqldb:taxify_gdpr_data_deletion>EXPLAIN ANALYZE /* gdpr-data-deletion-86bc85564d-kwr75|@privacy-backend|gdpr-data-deletion|cron_process|DeletionRetryingCron|live-gdprdatadeletion */\n                                             ->  SELECT\n                                          