ent Epic here: [L10N-28027](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28027)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-15T11:23:52.561Z"],["3812261","PC-4940","PC","roman.zavodskikh@bolt.eu","Roman Zavodskikh","Or not? [https://github.com/bolteu/admin-panel/pull/17144#discussion_r2693711215|https://github.com/bolteu/admin-panel/pull/17144#discussion_r2693711215] ","2026-01-15T11:23:54.338Z"],["3812262","LSS-55593","LSS","mare.heinluht@bolt.eu","Mare Heinluht","FYI I’ll be off starting tomorrow and won’t have a chance to deal with this until I’m back the first week of February. \nMeanwhile, when is the new RPP for Sweden joining? Do you know Lilli? Would love to include them in this. ","2026-01-15T11:24:05.804Z"],["3812265","DBRE-8701","DBRE","leandro.morgado@bolt.eu","Leandro Ricardo Rodrigues Morgado","Also added plan binding for heavy “archiver” query, now it’s not doing full table scan and uses index instead\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-15 at 11.23.12.png|width=759,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-15 at 11.23.12.png\"!\n\n\n\n{noformat}root@ti-user-dba.sqldb:taxify_gdpr_data_deletion>EXPLAIN ANALYZE /* gdpr-data-deletion-86bc85564d-r5dw7|@privacy-backend|gdpr-data-deletion|cron_process|ArchiverJobStatusSyncCron|live-gdprdatadeletion */\n                                             ->  SELECT\n                                             ->    /*+ MAX_EXECUTION_TIME(60000) */\n                                             ->    a.id,\n                                             ->    a.archiver_job_id,\n                                             ->    a.status,\n                                             ->    tdc.operation_type\n                                             ->  FROM\n                                             ->    `archiver_job` AS a\n                                             ->    JOIN `table_deletion_configuration` AS tdc ON a.table_deletion_configuration_id = tdc.id\n                                             ->  WHERE\n                                             ->    a.status = 'created'\n                                             ->    AND a.last_update < NOW() - INTERVAL 7200 SECOND\n                                             ->  ORDER BY\n                                             ->    a.id\n                                             ->  LIMIT\n                                             ->    10\\G\n***************************[ 1. row ]***************************\nid             | Limit_18\nestRows        | 10.00\nactRows        | 0\ntask           | root\naccess object  |\nexecution info | time:1.62s, loops:1, RU:53857.151408\noperator info  | offset:0, count:10\nmemory         | N/A\ndisk           | N/A\n***************************[ 2. row ]***************************\nid             | └─IndexJoin_64\nestRows        | 10.00\nactRows        | 0\ntask           | root\naccess object  |\nexecution info | time:1.62s, loops:1\noperator info  | inner join, inner:TableReader_61, outer key:taxify_gdpr_data_deletion.archiver_job.table_deletion_configuration_id, inner key:taxify_gdpr_data_deletion.table_deletion_configuration.id, equal cond:eq(taxify_gdpr_data_deletion.archiver_job.table_deletion_configuration_id, taxify_gdpr_data_deletion.table_deletion_configuration.id)\nmemory         | 0 Bytes\ndisk           | N/A\n***************************[ 3. row ]***************************\nid             |   ├─TableReader_70(Build)\nestRows        | 9.87\nactRows        | 0\ntask           | root\naccess object  |\nexecution info | time:1.62s, loops:1, cop_task: {num: 16, max: 1.62s, min: 812.3µs, avg: 1.37s, p95: 1.62s, max_proc_keys: 2568634, p95_proc_keys: 2568634, tot_proc: 21.9s, tot_wait: 7.97ms, copr_cache_hit_ratio: 0.00, build_task_duration: 35.3µs, max_distsql_concurrency: 15}, rpc_info:{Cop:{num_rpc:16, total_time:21.9s}}\noperator info  | data:Selection_69\nmemory         | 3.47 KB\ndisk           | N/A\n***************************[ 4. row ]***************************\nid             |   │ └─Se