ment 4 paid\n\n[https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14-YsqmabouSPqX45eDXPxYM0tA55RAJG|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14-YsqmabouSPqX45eDXPxYM0tA55RAJG]","2026-01-16T06:30:22.033Z"],["3814196","PFI-777012","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! Taking over here 🙂 Can you please share an example of which bonuses are missing exactly? What’s the amount and date applied? If there are several, then just a few examples may help 🙂 ","2026-01-16T06:31:16.072Z"],["3814197","TAXP-637","TAXP","dammian.kivuva@bolt.eu","Dammian Kivuva","There were no taxes to pay in December based on the projected performance.\n\n\n\n[https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eXJgo-EwWHhcjMzH0iKCvtqGmCS_dS8D|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eXJgo-EwWHhcjMzH0iKCvtqGmCS_dS8D|smart-card]","2026-01-16T06:32:07.821Z"],["3814204","PFI-828998","PFI","paweena.songchaijaroen@bolt-outsource.eu","Paweena Songchaijaroen","Dear payment team,\n\nKindly follow up for this payment.\n\nThank you in advance.","2026-01-16T06:42:32.046Z"],["3814205","MLC-660","MLC","jimmy.soldatos@bolt.eu","Jimmy Soldatos","W3:\n\n* Launched updated canvas with new templates\n* No update on the event for the follow-up message and Agnė is on sabbatical until Feb\n* Followed up on dev-logistics thread but no solution yet for the onelink/deeplink issue, scheduled a message again for Monday","2026-01-16T06:42:36.466Z"],["3814207","PFI-834003","PFI","nithi.aungkasiriwanont@bolt-outsource.eu","Nithi Aungkasiriwanont","!1768544958594.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260116-064307.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-16T06:43:41.293Z"],["3814215","PFI-801465","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! Taking this over. Will follow up with engineering on that and keep you updated 🙂 ","2026-01-16T06:46:47.891Z"],["3814216","PFI-801465","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","\n\n[https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02C2SY0MHT/p1768545804776559?thread_ts=1768301694.564939&cid=C02C2SY0MHT|https://taxify.slack.com/archive