6ae30dd3] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^Vyriausybės atstovų įstaiga. Specialiosios sąlygos. Bolt Business (1).adoc] ","2026-01-16T14:49:06.525Z"],["3816629","LSS-61381","LSS","ksenia.korolkova@bolt.eu","Ksenia Korolkova","Hi [~accountid:712020:52cfdad6-7e7c-4e24-b869-dd2ab87c9432] these documents need to be signed as separate files, as they are required for different banks. Please kindly ensure that each document is signed separately. Thank you!","2026-01-16T14:49:13.234Z"],["3816630","PRF-1848","PRF","filipa.ferrao@bolt.eu","Filipa Salgueiro Ferrão","Hey [~accountid:5c2f512d36647b5b91017d0c]PT Feedback: \n\nFor *V1* please consider the following sentence instead: Este é o valor que podes poupar este mês em viagens e entregas\n*V2*, *3* and *4* are ok 🙏🏼","2026-01-16T14:49:17.128Z"],["3816634","BB-2271","BB","uladzislau.klimiankou@bolt.eu","Vlad Klimenkov","[~accountid:62cebed2afe495359d9dc574] when is deadline?","2026-01-16T14:50:13.882Z"],["3816635","PFI-834287","PFI","ogechukwu.ohaji@bolt-outsource.eu","Ogechukwu Ohaji","!image-20260116-145012.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-16T14:50:29.957Z"],["3816636","MLC-2935","MLC","durrah.abdullah@bolt.eu","Durrah Abdullah","*Update*: Post-analysis data compiled [here|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1HM7EX4ECrZAoqxXEmtipqi6KXnvETKD-QIvpCibOD5M/edit?gid=505065407#gid=505065407]\n\n*Next Steps*: Review and create post analysis conclusion","2026-01-16T14:50:34.409Z"],["3816637","LSS-60899","LSS","jacqueline.tiessi@bolt.eu","Jacqueline Tiessi","Yes, with a few clarifications:\n\n*Central* – Correct regarding blocking drivers under 4.66; however, the exact number of warnings required before blocking has not yet been defined. More details will be shared once the process is fully set. Ratings are analysed monthly.\n\n*France* – Correct, drivers with a rating below 4.0 and more than 3 warnings are blocked. In addition, we are want introduce blocking for drivers with ratings between 4.0 and 4.5 who have more than 3 warnings. Ratings are based on weekly data.","2026-01-16T14:50:35.015Z"],["3816639","LSS-61546","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^14.01.2026 BOLT Operations NDA Mutual (FINAL 14.1.2026) (1).pdf] ","2026-01-16T14:51:22.667Z"],["3816640","CCM-22283","CCM","peace.anumia@bolt-outsource.eu","Peace Anumia","[^New Training Request form _ Teleperformance (16th of January 26).xlsx]","2026-01-16T14:51:32.597Z"],["3816641","DISC-3725","DISC","oleh.zasadnyy@bolt.eu","Oleh Zasadnyy","hey [~accountid:61542c1fc669a60069155c82] , here are new builds:\n\n!CleanShot 2026-01-16 at 16.51.00@2x.png|width=415,alt=\"CleanShot 2026-01-16 at 16.51.00@2x.png\"!","2026-01-16T14:51:49.585Z"],["3816645","PFI-823140","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nI can see the Beehive ticket has been closed. Please let us know if you still need any assistance and we will reopen this ticket. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-16T14:52:38.739Z"],["3816647","BB-2277","BB","yeshwant.kumar@bolt.eu","Yeshwant Kumar","Rejected :[https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01K5CYD5T5/p1768232983301569?thread_ts=1768210203.086459&cid=C01K5CYD5T5|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01K5CYD5T5/p1768232983301569?thread_ts=1768210203.086459&cid=C01K5CYD5T5|smart-link] ","2026-01-16T14:53:07.071Z"],["3816648","LSS-61476","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:02e8ad5d-a35d-44b9-b445-6111cdb230dc] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^Bolt_Driver_OM_Order on Assigment of Duties_LT.docx.adoc] ","2026-01-16T14:53:07.863Z"],["3816649","DPM-2321","DPM","pawel.dabrowski@bolt.eu","Paweł Dąbrowski","[~accountid:712020:a5a9bde0-6d51-468a-85a6-ee3e42b31f73] can you please check again as Cognizant team just shared they still encounter this issue when importing CSV\n","2026-01-16T14:53:11.327Z"],["3816665","DRX-27521","DRX","aji