ofile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-16T22:59:59.234Z"],["3817142","PFI-830094","PFI","valeria.safarova@bolt-outsource.eu","Valeria Safarova","Hey! Any updates?\n\n","2026-01-16T23:35:59.902Z"],["3817143","PFI-834478","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-16T23:56:48.279Z"],["3817144","PFI-834480","PFI","florina.braga@bolt-outsource.eu","Florina Nicoleta Braga","!IMG_0166.jpeg|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T00:26:51.742Z"],["3817145","PFI-834481","PFI","sabila.totha@bolt-outsource.eu","Sabila Totha","!IMG_20260117_070236.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image_480.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T00:27:22.662Z"],["3817146","PFI-834483","PFI","sabila.totha@bolt-outsource.eu","Sabila Totha","!IMG_20260116_091324.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!IMG_20260117_070306.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image_480.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T00:41:45.737Z"],["3817147","PFI-834484","PFI","suttipat.poenchaichuai@bolt-outsource.eu","Suttipat Poenchaichuai","!image (1).jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image_480.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T00:41:55.894Z"],["3817149","PFI-834467","PFI","nikolai.rol@bolt.eu","Nikolay Roll","👋 Hey there!\n\nLooks like you've selected an *invalid Request Type* which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! 🚗\n\n*PAYMENTS*\n* *[Customer Payments]* Driver/Fleet payment didn't reflect: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/311]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Manual payout request to Payments team: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/432]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Driver/Fleet payout issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/312]\n* *[Customer Payments]* Rider payment/charge issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/307]\n\n----\n\n*TECH SUPPORT*\n* *Driver/Fleet Campaign and Bonus issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/597]\n* *Driver app/backend/earning screen issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66]\n* *Rider app/backend issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/103]\n* *Wrong price calculation for the order:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/354]\n\n----\n\n*FRAUD*\n* *Fraud related issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/308]\n\n----\n\n*BILLING*\n* *Driver/Fleet Balance Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet Invoicing and Reports Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet/Rider Fiscalization (e.g. Missing QR, SAF-T) issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247]\n* *Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301]\n\nCheers,\n_Billing Ops AI_\n\nThis an automated message created to help resolving requests using our available knowledge base and tools. In case of any doubts or concerns please leave the comment, and our team will revert shortly. Alternatively, please, ask in *#commerce-support-billing* Slack channel.","2026-01-17T01:00:55.925Z"],["3817150","PFI-834490","PFI","phattana.ratsamee@bolt-outsource.eu","Phattana Ratsamee","!JPEG_1768605027669_8662818925147325019.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!JPEG_1768611964364_5435744801136021277.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T01:26:04.906Z"],["3817152","PFI-834494","PFI","phakphoom.jiangviset@bolt-outsource.eu","Phakphoom Jiangviset","!image-20260117-020251.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260117-020259.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T02:04:38.534Z"],["3817153","PFI-834495","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-17T02:11:43.585Z"],["3817155","FDBT-4793","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-17T03:05:57.854Z"],["3817157","CCM-22284","CCM","ademola.oloja@bolt-outsource.eu","Ademola Oloja","[^Wave 3 Food Delivery LMS Request.xlsx]","2026-01-17T03:48:36.220Z"],["3817163","PFI-834500","PFI","pisut.thongpan@bolt-outsource.eu","Pisut Thongpan","!1768616699317.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!IMG_20260117_104928.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260117-042931.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T04:31:24.514Z"],["3817164","PFI-834501","PFI","chatrawee.saenwerm@bolt-outsource.eu","Chatrawee Saenwerm","!image-20260117-043506.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260117-043525.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T04:36:07.825Z"],["3817166","PFI-834503","PFI","puttipong.wiputkrut@bolt-outsource.eu","Puttipong Wiputkrut","!image-20260117-045348.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260117-045400.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T04:55:17.990Z"],["3817170","PFI-834495","PFI","nikolai.rol@bolt.eu","Nikolay Roll","👋 Hi there!\n*Adjustments, Compensations*\n* If driver was compensated a while ago in some CS ticket - and this compensation is still not added to driver's balance -> please raise it with Local operations.\n\n*Why?* \nWhen Compensation is created in CS ticket -> it gets added to a csv file. Then local ops take it once a month and submit it into Manual Adjustment tool. They might submit it late, or submitting csv file gets delayed.\n\n\n*Campaign Bonus*\n* If driver did not recevei a bonus for a campaign -> please raise it with campaign team.\n\n*Why?*\nBilling team does not handle campaign setups. So we do not know when, why, how drivers should receive bonuses.\n\nThank you for submitting the ticket.\n\nBest regards,  \n_Billing Ops AI_\n\nThis an automated message created to help resolving requests using our available knowledge base and tools. In case of any doubts or concerns please leave the comment, and our team will revert shortly. Alternatively, please, ask in *#commerce-support-billing* Slack channel.","2026-01-17T05:00:59.774Z"],["3817171","PFI-834478","PFI","nikolai.rol@bolt.eu","Nikolay Roll","👋 Hi there!\n*Rider needs to change details on invoice*\nTo comply with tax regulations, we are unable to re-issue rider invoices. Please advise the user to ensure that their Personal or Work Profile information is correct and that they select the right Billing Profile _before_ taking a ride, just as they would choose the correct payment method in advance.\n\n*Invoice in Romania is missing a number*\nIf the invoice is missing a number, please mention this in the ticket comments so we can review it manually.\n\n*Where to find the invoice*\nPlease use KB article to find the invoice: https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/360003866399\n\nThank you for submitting the ticket.\n\nBest regards,  \n_Billing Ops AI_\n\nThis an automated message created to help resolving requests using our available knowledge base and tools. In case of any doubts or concerns please leave the comment, and our team will revert shortly. Alternatively, please, ask in *#commerce-support-billing* Slack channel.","2026-01-17T05:01:00.693Z"],["3817180","FDBT-4799","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-17T05:02:51.763Z"],["3817182","WFM-10026","WFM","anhelina.babych@bolt.eu","Anhelina Babych","missing roles, [req|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/admin-access-request/access-requests/view/601703] submitted","2026-01-17T05:08:03.369Z"],["3817183","WFM-10027","WFM","anhelina.babych@bolt.eu","Anhelina Babych","Hi [~accountid:64182443b05b4e3e7daa195b] , \nYou have already submitted a request with this list of agents on grating access to the DE queue  under this request [https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/1068/WFM-10026|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/1068/WFM-10026|smart-link] . I will be closing this one as a dublicate.","2026-01-17T05:11:59.317Z"],["3817185","FDBT-4706","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-17T05:16:24.443Z"],["3817187","PFI-834507","PFI","ales.kvetensky@bolt-outsource.eu","Ales Kvetensky","!0804c08e-bd60-47f8-b216-27de7fcec984.png|thumbnail!\n\n!788020a6-6bee-4aef-9801-e27706ccc3c0.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T05:20:30.871Z"],["3817189","PFI-834509","PFI","nicolle.zablocki@bolt-outsource.eu","Nicolle Zablocki","[^Transakce_2000023206608675.pdf]","2026-01-17T05:46:07.422Z"],["3817190","PFI-834478","PFI","oluwaseyi.adekoya@bolt-outsource.eu","Oluwaseyi Adekoya","Dear team, the rider’s work profile details have the company details on it, and the billing profile used was business.","2026-01-17T06:04:31.487Z"],["3817219","LSS-60351","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Debbie Meijer,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-17T07:00:35.365Z"],["3817220","LSS-60105","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear John Buckley,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-17T07:00:36.035Z"],["3817221","LSS-58632","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Patrik Piščák,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-17T07:00:36.237Z"],["3817224","LSS-59965","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Paulina Siłkowska,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-17T07:00:37.753Z"],["3817225","LSS-57416","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Daniel Severin,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-17T07:00:37.880Z"],["3817227","LSS-58352","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Rachael Irimu,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-17T07:00:39.093Z"],["3817229","PFI-826633","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Daniel Petrea,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://ta