ket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:12.697Z"],["3817247","PFI-823487","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Arno Booyzen,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:12.871Z"],["3817248","PFI-817837","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Damian Zielinski,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:13.390Z"],["3817249","PFI-814407","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Erik Semet,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:13.580Z"],["3817250","PFI-813698","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Maret Ansperi-Mälberg,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:14.235Z"],["3817251","PFI-812251","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Mark Bauer,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:14.323Z"],["3817252","PFI-811647","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 John Khambo,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:14.412Z"],["3817253","PFI-810222","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Maret Ansperi-Mälberg,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:14.447Z"],["3817254","PFI-805970","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Ernests Suskevics,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-17T07:01:14.855Z"],["3817255","LSS-60620","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Merve Yilmaz,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-17T07:01:32.103Z"],["3817256","LSS-60561","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Elisabetta Furfaro Jerusalmy,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-17T07:01:32.631Z"],["3817257","LSS-60566","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Joyanne Njau,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-17T07:01:32.833Z"],["3817258","LSS-60612","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Merve Yilmaz,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-17T07:01:32.949Z"],["3817259","LSS-60486","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Maria Ingvoldstad,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-17T07:01:34.091Z"],["3817260","PFI-834520","PFI","ernests.suskevics@bolt-outsource.eu","Ernests Suskevics","!Screenshot 2026-01-17 090216.png|thumbnail!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-17 090221.png|thumbnail!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-17 090230.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T07:03:20.768Z"],["3817261","PFI-834275","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-17T07:06:47.967Z"],["3817262","PFI-834309","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-17T07:06:50.124Z"],["3817264","PFI-833976","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout is still pending; the last log on 11 Jan shows “payment validation in progress,” which means the provider is running a compliance review. As it has been pending for several business days, a delay is possible—our team is monitoring these cases and responds to any compliance requests promptly; no action is needed from the partner at this time. Please inform the partner that the payout will complete once the review finishes and the status will update automatically.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-17T07:12:30.320Z"],["3817265","PFI-834009","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This Early Cashout is still in pending status (last update on 2026-01-13), which is a bit longer than usual; it may be delayed due to a compliance review or technical processing on the payment provider’s side. The Partner Payments team is monitoring it and will respond to any compliance requests promptly; no action is needed from the courier at this time. Please inform the partner that the payout will be completed as soon as the review finishes, and the funds should then reach their account shortly after.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-17T07:12:57.264Z"],["3817266","PFI-834041","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout was rejected because the beneficiary bank account is closed; please ask the partner to update their payout details to an active/open bank account (correct IBAN/account number, bank code, and account name). Once the details are fixed, the payout will be reprocessed in the next regular payout cycle; for Early Cashout, they can try again after updating their bank info. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-17T07:13:32.753Z"],["3817267","PFI-834047","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still pending; the last update on 2026-01-11 shows that bank validation is in progress. As it has been pending for several business days, it’s likely delayed due to an ongoing compliance review or technical checks on the provider’s side; we are monitoring it and will respond to any bank requests immediately. No action is required from the partner now—the payout will proceed automatically once validation is completed and the status will update accordingly.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-17T07:13:58.951Z"],["3817268","PFI-834050","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still pending with the provider and under payment validation (last update: 2026-01-11), which is longer than usual. This delay is likely due to an ongoing compliance review or technical check on the provider’s side; we are monitoring it and will respond to any requests immediately. Please inform the partner that no action is required from their side right now and the payout will be processed once validation completes.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-17T07:14:21.050Z"],["3817269","PFI-834078","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still in pending status because the payment provider is performing a validation review, which can delay processing. The last update was on 12 Jan, so please inform the partner that the delay is due to this validation and the payout will be processed once it’s completed. We are monitoring the case and responding to any provider requests; no action is required from the partner at this time. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase.","2026-01-17T07:14:47.797Z"],["3817270","PFI-834179","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout for 5 Jan is still pending because the payment provider is performing additional validation/compliance checks. This has been pending longer than usual; our team is monitoring it and will proceed as soon as the provider clears it—no action is needed from the partner right now. Please inform the partner that the payout will be processed automatically once the validation is completed.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-17T07:15:16.697Z"],["3817271","PFI-834197","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed (state: finished on 2026-01-06, value date 2026-01-05). Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still cannot locate the funds, ask them to contact their bank with the proof to trace the credit. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-17T07:15:36.056Z"],["3817272","PFI-834228","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This Early Cashout payout was rejected by the payment provider, and they did not provide a specific reason. Please inform the partner that they can try requesting the Early Cashout again now, or they can wait for the next regular payout cycle when it will be reprocessed automatically. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-17T07:15:58.027Z"],["3817273","PFI-834245","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The latest payout was exported on 2026-01-12, which means it has been sent for processing and is still in progress. As it has remained in this state for several days, the delay is likely due to a compliance review or temporary processing issues; we are monitoring it and no action is needed from the partner right now. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase.","2026-01-17T07:16:36.120Z"],["3817274","PFI-834274","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed; value date 2026-01-13 (state: finished on 2026-01-14). Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the driver as evidence; if they still cannot see the funds, ask them to check with their bank using the value date.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-17T07:17:05.841Z"],["3817275","PFI-834317","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout shows as finished with value date 2026-01-15. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they believe it went to the wrong account, ask them to verify/update their bank details for future payouts and contact their bank with the proof to trace/recall the funds. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-17T07:17:27.065Z"],["3817276","PFI-834275","PFI","ivaniuk.habriella@bolt-outsource.eu","Ivaniuk Habriella","incorrect link","2026-01-17T07:25:53.110Z"],["3817278","PFI-834528","PFI","ivaniuk.habriella@bolt-outsource.eu","Ivaniuk Habriella","!IMG_20260116_143103_941.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T07:28:48.125Z"],["3817282","PFI-834531","PFI","sararat.wanthai@bolt-outsource.eu","Sararat Wanthai","!image-20260117-074104.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260117-074114.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T07:42:40.324Z"],["3817283","FDBT-4796","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_pipeline_metrics fails on 2026-01-16 05:30:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInstance._execute_task_with_callbacks(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib