nk]  their minimum is like 1000eur for “suupistevalik” 😬 , think we can send inquiry and see how much actually it’d be.\n\n*Total approx: 1695.2EUR*  the total will depend on food cost+bar limit","2026-01-17T09:10:07.858Z"],["3817302","DBRE-8458","DBRE","juri.hudolejev@bolt.eu","Juri Hudolejev","Ansible fails on {{monitor}} nodes: [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09T8620KLK/p1768641491523599?thread_ts=1768629919.919839&cid=C09T8620KLK|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09T8620KLK/p1768641491523599?thread_ts=1768629919.919839&cid=C09T8620KLK|smart-link].\n\nUPD. Handled in [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/DBRE-8711|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/DBRE-8711|smart-link] .","2026-01-17T09:18:56.899Z"],["3817303","PFI-822646","PFI","anastasiia.levytska@bolt-outsource.eu","Anastasiia Levytska","Hi! Its been 3 weeks since this request was created, can you please check and solve this?","2026-01-17T09:20:21.624Z"],["3817304","DBRE-8711","DBRE","andres.kepler@bolt.eu","Andres Kepler","[https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09T8620KLK/p1768641491523599?thread_ts=1768629919.919839&cid=C09T8620KLK|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09T8620KLK/p1768641491523599?thread_ts=1768629919.919839&cid=C09T8620KLK|smart-link]","2026-01-17T09:20:36.703Z"],["3817305","DBRE-8711","DBRE",null,"Slack","[Andres Kepler|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/6215e9ed2d1a9d0069952697] synced this conversation thread with the Slack thread [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09T8620KLK/p1768641602385899?thread_ts=1768632400.908229&cid=C09T8620KLK|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09T8620KLK/p1768641602385899?thread_ts=1768632400.908229&cid=C09T8620KLK|smart-link]. Replies in synced threads will automatically update across both Slack and Jira.","2026-01-17T09:20:37.866Z"],["3817306","PFI-834317","PFI","chidiebere.ukaegbu@bolt-outsource.eu","Chidiebere Ukaegbu","HI team,\n\nThe driver has confirmed and provided their correct banking details, as the account details the payout was sent out to is\n\n[^Proof of payout 233771363 (1).pdf]\n\n not the driver’s bank account details. Please find attached\n\n[^DOC-20260117-WA0005. 02.pdf]\n\n the proof of payment sent to the driver and the driver’s correct account details. ","2026-01-17T09:21:25.465Z"],["3817308","PFI-833568","PFI","radka.remenikova@bolt-outsource.eu","Radka Remenikova","any update please? ","2026-01-17T09:24:22.617Z"],["3817312","PFI-830381","PFI","chiamaka.mmeka@bolt-outsource.eu","Chiamaka Mmeka","Hi Team\n\nPlease what’s the update on this report.","2026-01-17T09:59:18.580Z"],["3817313","PFI-834589","PFI","faith.ndonye@bolt-outsource.eu","Faith Ndonye","[^transaction-confirmation-report_en-gb_ac6402.pdf]","2026-01-17T09:59:46.596Z"],["3817314","DBRE-8712","DBRE","leandro.morgado@bolt.eu","Leandro Ricardo Rodrigues Morgado","Disk space has been shrinking over the last week. It is also need to support alter automation. Other nodes on the cluster have close to 1TB free which allows AA request to run ( currently there is a 600GB+ request pending).\n\n\n{noformat}root@central-kafka:[REPLICA@09:50:42]:~# df -h /mysql/\nFilesystem                 Size  Used Avail Use% Mounted on\n/dev/mapper/mysqlvg-mysql   11T   11T  398G  97% /mysql{noformat}","2026-01-17T10:00:11.765Z"],["3817315","DBRE-8712","DBRE","leandro.morgado@bolt.eu","Leandro Ricardo Rodrigues Morgado","* Disk space has been increased\n\n{noformat}root@central-kafka:[REPLICA@10:06:09]:~# df -h /mysql/\nFilesystem                 Size  Used Avail Use% Mounted on\n/dev/mapper/mysqlvg-mysql   12T   11T  1.4T  89% /mysql{noformat}","2026-01-17T10:06:30.751Z"],["3817324","PFI-815029","PFI","monika.jurcik@bolt-outsource.eu","Monika Jurčík","Hello, any update pls? ","2026-01-17T10:31:45.453Z"],["3817354","PFI-834634","PFI","andreas.aslaksrud@bolt-outsource.eu","Andreas Aslaksrud","!image-20260117-113459.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T11:37:24.380Z"],["3817360","PFI-828294","PFI","klaudia.wojciechowska@bolt-outsource.eu","Klaudia Wojciechowska","Hi