n-access-request/access-requests/view/541767|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/admin-access-request/access-requests/view/541767] (approved)\n\nThe requestor opened a second ticket to ask for the roles here: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WFM-10029|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WFM-10029|smart-link] ","2026-01-17T19:42:19.220Z"],["3817442","WFM-10029","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Duplicate ticket: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WFM-10028|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WFM-10028]\n\nI will inform her that I will close this one and solve the two cases in the link shared above.","2026-01-17T19:45:13.907Z"],["3817443","WFM-10029","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Hello [~accountid:642a97a99f314a0a30143c18],\n\nPlease be informed that I will close this ticket as a duplicate.\n\nWe will proceed with your request on this ticket here: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WFM-10028|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WFM-10028] \n\nBest regards! ","2026-01-17T19:46:48.672Z"],["3817444","WFM-10030","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Agent’s profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/532718?tab=queues&queue_view=queue_list|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/532718?tab=queues&queue_view=queue_list]\n\nThe agent has been unassigned, WFM team, please update assembled if applicable.","2026-01-17T19:47:55.592Z"],["3817445","WFM-10005","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Agent’s profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/232948?tab=assembled|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/232948?tab=assembled]","2026-01-17T19:51:01.024Z"],["3817447","PFI-822092","PFI","monika.jurcik@bolt-outsource.eu","Monika Jurčík","Hello team, any update? ","2026-01-17T20:33:23.757Z"],["3817449","DPM-2321","DPM","artur.spunei@bolt.eu","Artur Spunei","[~accountid:621f66f84160640069c66ff4] Apologies for any confusion. This ticket was closed as a duplicate. The active work for this feature is being tracked in [DPM-2289|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/DPM-2289].","2026-01-17T20:54:48.647Z"],["3817455","PFI-834827","PFI","giorgi.chachava@bolt.eu","Giorgi Chachava","!driver_payment.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!transaction.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-17T22:03:21.902Z"],["3817456","PFI-834827","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-17T22:03:24.097Z"],["3817459","PFI-834831","PFI","george.ghiveciu@bolt.eu","George-Mihai Ghiveciu","[^wise_transfer_confirmation__transfer__1807700306__6726687695__ro-3 (3).pdf]","2026-01-17T22:34:03.372Z"],["3817461","PFI-834836","PFI","george.ghiveciu@bolt.eu","George-Mihai Ghiveciu","[^Tranzactie_30-12-2025_13-10-41 (8).pdf]","2026-01-17T22:51:06.903Z"],["3817462","PFI-834838","PFI","george.ghiveciu@bolt.eu","George-Mihai Ghiveciu","[^PaymentProof149ZEXA2534700EM (1).pdf]","2026-01-17T22:56:47.784Z"],["3817464","RDS-951","RDS","dashiell.stanford@bolt.eu","Dash Stanford","{quote}Do we know how many Riders are using this option? If adoption is small, I would consider killing it entirely.{quote}\n\nAdoption is absolutely terrible, something like <2% if I recall correctly. But it is specifically because of this terrible UX. \n\nI think the solution is not to kill the profile photo completely (which makes riders seem even less trustworthy and reliable), but rather to actually build this correctly and close this feature gap with comp once and for all. The solution is so obvious, we’ve just never had the capacity/agreement to prioritise it. ","2026-01-17T23:15:26.119Z"],["3817469","PFI-806995","PFI","julia.lechwar@bolt-outsource.eu","Julia Lechwar","hi, any news? ","2026-01-18T00:31:08.764Z"],["3817470","PFI-834843","PFI","peter.uyokei@bolt-outsource.eu","Peter Uyokei","!image-20260118-004411.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-18T00:44:21.890Z"],["3817471","PFI-834844","PFI","sabila.totha@bolt-outsource.eu","Sabila Totha","!JPEG_1768656180061_1150831858193681816.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!JPEG_1768696578250_4881437983802710213.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image_480.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-18T00:57:49.437Z"],["3817473","PFI-834827","PFI","nikolai.rol@bolt.eu","Nikolay Roll","👋 Hey there!\n\nLooks like you've selected an *invalid Request Type* which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! 🚗\n\n*PAYMENTS*\n* *[Customer Payments]* Driver/Fleet payment didn't reflect: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/311]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Manual payout request to Payments team: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/432]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Driver/Fleet payout issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/312]\n* *[Customer Payments]* Rider payment/charge issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/307]\n\n----\n\n*TECH SUPPORT*\n* *Driver/Fleet Campaign and Bonus issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/597]\n* *Driver app/backend/earning screen issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66]\n* *Rider app/backend issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/103]\n* *Wrong price calculation for the order:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/354]\n\n----\n\n*FRAUD*\n* *Fraud related issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/308]\n\n----\n\n*BILLING*\n* *Driver/Fleet Balance Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet Invoicing and Reports Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet/Rider Fiscalization (e.g. Missing QR, SAF-T) issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247]\n* *Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301]\n\nCheers,\n_Billing Ops AI_\n\nThis an automated message created to help resolving requests using our available knowledge base and tools. In case of any doubts or concerns please leave the comment, and our team will revert shortly. Alternatively, please, ask in *#commerce-support-billing* Slack channel.","2026-01-18T01:00:47.489Z"],["3817482","PFI-834854","PFI","athitiya.daitooktang@bolt-outsource.eu","Athitiya Daitooktang","!image-20260118-030007.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260118-030026.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-18T03:02:06.739Z"],["3817484","FDBT-4802","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-18T03:08:50.175Z"],["3817487","PFI-834858","PFI","chargeback_reports@bolt.eu","chargeback_reports","\n\n[^M2309128.TXT] _(0.9 kB)_","2026-01-18T04:01:13.433Z"],["3817489","PFI-824321","PFI","georgios.bamos@bolt.eu","Georgios Thomas Bamos","Hello team. Another kind reminder to check this","2026-01-18T04:52:18.236Z"],["3817490","PFI-834861","PFI","supattra.lakam@bolt-outsource.eu","Supattra Lakam","!Messenger_creation_1FCD8758-0F8A-42B2-B251-A20EB702D3A1.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!Messenger_creation_71638DA9-ACDE-4A43-AE44-4448B6822C30.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260118-045444.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-18T04:56:09.117Z"],["3817491","FDBT-4804","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-18T04:58:20.318Z"],["3817493","PFI-834