ed audience or scope of use, please double-check that permissions still reflect this.\n\n*If this ticket was for deleting a CustomGPT*\nThe deletion has been approved and the CustomGPT has been removed from the Legal & Compliance [toolstack tracker|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jj2Mm-dJmnP6W4dBdFQZwrm2FGM0YTyTt2nC9i8BFQE/edit?gid=261811728#gid=261811728].\n\n***\n\nIf, at any point, you make changes to the CustomGPT (including prompt, data sources, functionality, or audience), or if you wish to delete it, a new ticket is required for approval.\n\nIf anything changes or you’re unsure whether an update requires a new ticket, it’s always safest to submit one so we can keep approvals and the toolstack tracker accurate.\n\nThank you,\nLegal Ops","2026-01-19T07:00:50.422Z"],["3818040","LSS-60820","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Gabrielė Kaveckytė, your CustomGPT request has been approved ✅\n\n*If this ticket was for a new CustomGPT*\nYour CustomGPT is now approved for use and has been added to the Legal & Compliance [toolstack tracker|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jj2Mm-dJmnP6W4dBdFQZwrm2FGM0YTyTt2nC9i8BFQE/edit?gid=261811728#gid=261811728]. Before broader use, please ensure the permissions and intended audience are set correctly.\n\n*If this ticket was for updating an existing CustomGPT*\nThe requested changes have been approved and the [toolstack tracker|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jj2Mm-dJmnP6W4dBdFQZwrm2FGM0YTyTt2nC9i8BFQE/edit?gid=261811728#gid=261811728] has been updated accordingly. If the edits affect the intended audience or scope of use, please double-check that permissions still reflect this.\n\n*If this ticket was for deleting a CustomGPT*\nThe deletion has been approved and the CustomGPT has been removed from the Legal & Compliance [toolstack tracker|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jj2Mm-dJmnP6W4dBdFQZwrm2FGM0YTyTt2nC9i8BFQE/edit?gid=261811728#gid=261811728].\n\n***\n\nIf, at any point, you make changes to the Cust