rce of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-28488](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28488)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-19T08:44:21.218Z"],["3818578","L10N-28503","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-28488](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28488)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-19T08:44:22.827Z"],["3818579","PFI-834295","PFI","karl.kutsar@bolt.eu","Karl Kristjan Kutsar","Hey Christos, decision to keep the pre-auth was due to increased risk, which proved to be correct. The total price after pre-auth was 15.01 EUR, for which they lacked funds, and it resulted in a failed payment. The uncovered amount (12.01 EUR) reflects as negative balance on their account. So this is not a fraud issue.\nPlease advise them that they have unpaid amounts to be topped up or paid with the next order.\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 10.41.59.png|width=1278,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 10.41.59.png\"!","2026-01-19T08:44:27.874Z"],["3818582","PAW-14948","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was approved by @xenJ\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/160993\nStatus: open\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-19 08:44:49 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-19T08:44:49.980Z"],["3818583","INT-826","INT","hans.tulmin@bolt.eu","Hans-Peeter Tulmin","26W04 picked up again and created the permissions sheet. Took the missing dimensions dependencies to engineering for scoping","2026-01-19T08:44:52.039Z"],["3818586","RCE-361","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Sergei Jakovlev [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1768812332055179]*{color}:\n:wave: Since work-time was included in the list, I applied the suggestions where it made sense. The following suggestions I did not apply\n• external-checks-latvia - it had higher utilization between Jan 6 and Jan 16, with some spikes in CPU usage. It is not clear to me why the utilization was so different from normal (fairly stable level over last 3 months, apart from those 10 days). Since we are out of the higher utilization period, did not seem reasonable to bump. \n• fleet-documents-block-cron - on January 15 there was clearly some change that triggered mass block changes and pinned CPU to 100%. This is sporadic. Better question is to decide what is the stable approach to this service. Automatic scaling would be great, but it is currently a global lock cron, meaning that a better strategy would need to be implemented. In any case, I did not see sufficient reason to bump it at the moment.\n• fleet-insurance-admin - RAM utilization seems to be below 50% over the entire last week, so I am not sure why it recommended bumping the limit.\n{quote}","2026-01-19T08:45:48.162Z"],["3818588","WFM-10033","WFM","artur.naago@bolt.eu","Artur Näägo","Hello, [~accountid:712020:b0d52b3e-b115-4590-88d6-6a2ff2d50540]!\r\n\r\nI confirm, that all three queues were added successfully.\r\n\r\nWith best wishes,\r\nArtur","2026-01-19T08:46:23.201Z"],["3818589","TS-4658","TS","laura.kaselaid@bolt.eu","Laura Kaselaid","I’ll email them about Food. 50 eur pp drinks should be more than okay 👌 \n\nAlso JFYI - ordering food should be done in bulk (not individually, I got last time a warning about it from Kerli) so i.e people go 2-3 groups then it should be fine on our end.","2026-01-19T08:46:24.872Z"],["3818591","DSR-3777","DSR","maksym.padalka@bolt.eu","Maksym Padalka","Updated the responsive data:\n1) Order history [*here*|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hKWHjpepnagMvW5Hk8ipeOsCXTYScDRI?usp=drive_link]\n2) Ratings [*here*|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17_NCBvCkYtueaSm7HUjI6Nqa95mFd5Wg?usp=drive_link]","2026-01-19T08:46:56.633Z"],["3818594","PFI-835292","PFI","elizabeth.okon@bolt-outsource.eu","Elizabeth Okon","[^DOC-20260113-WA0011..pdf]","2026-01-19T08:47:06.168Z"],["3818595","WD-22462","WD","magnus.vainumae@bolt.eu","Magnus Vainumäe","[~accountid:624d3e6a45ece00069cdb4e5] could you give us update regarding account certification set for PL004? If it is not yet in scope i will close this ticket and now ticket can be created when we need to assign roles to PL004 account certifications","2026-01-19T08:47:18.556Z"],["3818596","FX-3666","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*FleetX reports [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1768812479562589]*{color}:\nIssue FX-3666 successfully transitioned to state 'Done'.\n{quote}","2026-01-19T08:48:12.275Z"],["3818597","PFI-835295","PFI","anastacia.njunge@bolt.eu","Anastacia Njunge","!Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 11.35.43.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-19T08:48:12.521Z"],["3818599","LSS-54291","LSS","edik.davtian@bolt.eu","Edik Davtian","Morning team,\n\nI tried to put together a table with response.  [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1v-_yL6oocrk4wHRMfvlhSOMldYPaJLwHMr5hQHSgTOY/edit?gid=0#gid=0|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1v-_yL6oocrk4wHRMfvlhSOMldYPaJLwHMr5hQHSgTOY/edit?gid=0#gid=0|smart-link] \n\nPlease have a look [~accountid:712020:5067a0c1-57d4-43be-82ef-d8f1c03140a2] [~accountid:62b1c880566f3e7b0a8f2eb7]  today/tomorrow if possible - so we can send it to ATB & progress sooner.\n\n\n\nIf any questions -please do address.\n\nThanks in advance!","2026-01-19T08:48:18.624Z"],["3818602","PFI-834422","PFI","karl.kutsar@bolt.eu","Karl Kristjan Kutsar","Hey Joao, devices unblocked. Thanks!","2026-01-19T08:48:47.414Z"],["3818604","GRWA-1501","GRWA","zunair.butt@bolt.eu","Muhammad Zunair Butt","[https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C08UX5MD6AH/p1768799304396339?thread_ts=1768302314.677639&cid=C08UX5MD6AH|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C08UX5MD6AH/p1768799304396339?thread_ts=1768302314.677639&cid=C08UX5MD6AH|smart-link] ","2026-01-19T08:48:55.851Z"],["3818606","PFI-835296","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋 \nThanks for the ticket! While we get to your request, please make sure to check Configuration Requests Guide (https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/x/sQUQDAE) to see if you have added everything we need to the ticket, in order to make the process faster and more convenient! \n\nPlease note that, in this queue, we are handling requests related to fee calculators, base fee calculators, invoice issuers, commission changes, invoice layout changes.. etc.\n\nThank you! ","2026-01-19T08:49:36.668Z"],["3818607","BDB-1513","BDB","polina.petuhhova@bolt.eu","Polina Petuhhova","Hey [~accountid:5d5a47614aeeb80c2cc0d00a] \nPlease approve that all the previews I’ve sent are good to go and then I can create printing files. \nThank you!","2026-01-19T08:49:36.705Z"],["3818608","PFI-835296","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋 \nThank you for submitting a ticket to Billing! Looks like this ticket needs approval - [~accountId:712020:da3a34fc-4683-42dc-9868-0414839ff893] please approve this ticket in order to continue.\n\nCheers\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-19T08:49:38.276Z"],["3818611","LSS-61742","LSS","ketter.ots@bolt.eu","Ketter Ots","Hey [~accountid:712020:4e5ff1dc-ee66-40e6-8fdc-4c2ddd811bd4], thanks for reaching out! The CSPC team has provided instructions in the Beehive ticket.","2026-01-19T08:50:54.322Z"],["3818612","HS-28369","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","Employee has cancelled the request already on 6.01.","2026-01-19T08:50:57.330Z"],["3818613","WFM-10026","WFM","anhelina.babych@bolt.eu","Anhelina Babych","Hi team, missing roles were applied, please adjust the queues accordingly, thank you:)","2026-01-19T08:51:03.225Z"],["3818615","PFI-835298","PFI","elijah.ojeamien@bolt-outsource.eu","Elijah Ojeamien","[^BOLT OPERATIONS OU.pdf]","2026-01-19T08:51:38.328Z"],["3818626","LSS-59597","LSS","ann.koljalg@bolt.eu","Ann Kõljalg","[~accountid:712020:02e8ad5d-a35d-44b9-b445-6111cdb230dc] Happy Monday! How are we doing with the Finland lease agreement! When would you be able to complete the review?","2026-01-19T08:54:09.273Z"],["3818630","LSS-61569","LSS","maria.paraschiv@bolt.eu","Maria-Speranta Paraschiv","[~accountid:712020:56f6612f-2339-4803-8816-524c13c12724] could you kindly advise on the above? I would say that we will receive information of confidential nature from IDrive and we should not accept inaccuracy. Thank you!  ","2026-01-19T08:55:42.154Z"],["3818631","RDXENG-4610","RDXENG","grigorii.dzhanelidze@bolt.eu","Greg Dzhanelidze","[https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/7419298621/ETA+single+source+of+truth|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/7419298621/ETA+single+source+of+truth|smart-link] ","2026-01-19T08:55:45.583Z"],["3818633","WFM-10034","WFM","artur.naago@bolt.eu","Artur Näägo","Hello, [~accountid:712020:7ae1d3df-6896-4795-9202-4c3326a6e64b]\r\n\r\nI confirm that Play Mode for Yeva Marchenko is disabled.\r\n\r\nHave a great day,\r\nArtur","2026-01-19T08:56:05.329Z"],["3818635","HS-29039","HS","berit.mustonen@bolt.eu","Berit Mustonen","Hi Kevin, thank you for the request. I’ll start working on it. ","2026-01-19T08:56:38.191Z"],["3818637","SREC-375","SREC","amin.khoshnood@bolt.eu","Amin Khoshnood","*group-S067V1C08F6* What do you think [about this PR|https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/15442]?\nThis should merge all of the {{OktaENGInfoSecAdmin}} permissions to {{OktaENGCloudSec}}.\nAfter applying this, you can switch to the {{OktaENGCloudSec}} role.","2026-01-19T08:57:12.314Z"],["3818639","DBRE-8705","DBRE","kewei.shang@bolt.eu","Kewei Shang","{quote}<@U01AH7VKNHY{quote}\n\n> I see there’re two predicates for the {{taxify_payment.notification}} table:\n\n{quote}```created {quote}\n\n{quote}= '2026-01-15 21:00:00' AND created < '2026-01-15 22:59:00'\n_and:_\ncreated {quote}\n\n{quote}= '2026-01-18 05:00:00' AND created < '2026-01-18 06:05:00'```\nwhat is the reason for that? Was there another outage over the weekend?{quote}\n\nYes, there is another incident over the weekend sadly :disappointed:","2026-01-19T08:57:33.923Z"],["3818640","DBRE-8516","DBRE","juri.hudolejev@bolt.eu","Juri Hudolejev","Docs added: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SRE/pages/7420346435/How+to+upgrade+Ubuntu+on+ProxySQL+instance|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SRE/pages/7420346435/How+to+upgrade+Ubuntu+on+ProxySQL+instance|smart-link].\n\nAlso – needed for prelive and live upgrades:\n\n* Prelive: [https://github.com/bolteu/taxify-ansible/pull/5581|https://github.com/bolteu/taxify-ansible/pull/5581]\n* Live: [https://github.com/bolteu/taxify-ansible/pull/5586|https://github.com/bolteu/taxify-ansible/pull/5586]","2026-01-19T08:57:43.791Z"],["3818641","BDB-1461","BDB","sohniya.nair@bolt.eu","Sohniya Nair","Hi [~accountid:712020:f172cd28-e81b-4011-8942-5ec6b2912f37] \n\nHope you had a good weekend. Just taking over from [~accountid:5d289a7c3e09b40c262cfaa9] to check if you know when we would have the OOH media plan? Alex will be away next week on vacation from 26-29 January , we just want to make sure Hopp Plus OOH is done before she leaves, if not she will pick this up when she is back.  😀 \n\ncc: [~accountid:60ab71565dc18500701cae80] ","2026-01-19T08:57:55.447Z"],["3818642","WFM-10028","WFM","artur.naago@bolt.eu","Artur Näägo","Hi, [~accountid:642a97a99f314a0a30143c18]!\r\n\r\n*05 BU_Latvia_Business *queue has been assigned to *Estere Modilevska*.\r\n\r\nHave a great day,\r\nArtur","2026-01-19T08:58:44.119Z"],["3818643","MAB-233","MAB","balaji.senthilkumar@bolt.eu","Balaji Senthilkumar","Provided analytical support by delivering a user-level retention analysis for the Papa John’s brand in Azerbaijan to quantify the number of loyal customers and their order frequency on the platform. The analysis generated actionable insights into customer behavior and repeat usage patterns, enabling the leadership team to better understand retention performance. These insights were shared and discussed with the leadership team and Nikolai.\n\n[https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cSG81xE3uh2-17Lkg3us6un5adA5zH7E5HUSJxSxLB8/edit?gid=1185349543#gid=1185349543|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cSG81xE3uh2-17Lkg3us6un5adA5zH7E5HUSJxSxLB8/edit?gid=1185349543#gid=1185349543|smart-link] \n\n","2026-01-19T08:58:44.395Z"],["3818644","PFI-835301","PFI","daumantas.butvila@bolt-outsource.eu","Daumantas Butvila","[^BOLT payment 07.01.2026.pdf.pdf]","2026-01-19T08:58:45.917Z"],["3818645","LSS-61606","LSS","beatrice.grize@bolt.eu","Beatričė Grižė","Hey team,\n[~accountid:60acb13f1155bb006fce252c] could you please remind us what deadline you indicated for providing our response to this claim?\n\nGiven the scope of the claim, I suggest informing both the restaurant and the lawyer that we will not be able to provide a response before 30 January. If needed, I’m happy to help draft the text for this notification.\n\nThanks! ","2026-01-19T08:59:00.302Z"],["3818647","LSS-61758","LSS","sandra.loewe@bolt.eu","Sandra Löwe","[^Urban Drive Co-Invest + Kick-Back - Bolt Cooperation Agreement - Germany.docx] _(55 kB)_","2026-01-19T08:59:33.974Z"],["3818650","PFI-835302","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nBusiness ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=282576311\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-19T09:00:37.303Z"],["3818654","DRAG-636","DRAG","hendrik.vorno@bolt.eu","Hendrik Võrno","D3 motors will arrive to CN office on {{2026-01-20}} and will then ship to Tallinn via Economy Air. Cobra EMC-fix controllers will be sent in the same shipment.\n\n\n\nETA 20 days.","2026-01-19T09:01:20.391Z"],["3818655","PFI-832852","PFI","mateusz.zawadzki@bolt.eu","Mateusz Zawadzki","We are still waiting for input from [~accountid:712020:33a1a5e8-52cb-4605-9ef3-0b89d57fe7b8]  or [~accountid:557058:b2aaf2b9-4465-40fe-b31b-1711dbe61946] ","2026-01-19T09:01:21.273Z"],["3818657","BDB-1494","BDB","marinella.farrugia@bolt.eu","Marinella Farrugia","[~accountid:712020:aa01e2da-d94d-4529-a5fb-d7a1a21e0b79] thanks! can you please update the figma mock up please?","2026-01-19T09:01:25.794Z"],["3818659","WD-19452","WD",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi, we haven't heard from you in a in 21 days. The ticket will be closed due to no response in 7 days. \n\n","2026-01-19T09:01:27.068Z"],["3818661","WD-19452","WD",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi, we haven't heard from you in a while. The ticket will be closed due to no response in over 28 days. If the matter is still relevant, please submit a new ticket.\n","2026-01-19T09:01:34.441Z"],["3818662","WD-22462","WD",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi, we haven't heard from you in 7 days.","2026-01-19T09:01:46.850Z"],["3818665","TS-4658","TS","aleksandr.bregin@bolt.eu","Aleksandr Bregin","Yes, that’s what I was thinking in terms of ordering & eating too - we can divide into 3 groups of 5-6 people that either order or go outside and buy some food from one place. I think if we have 3 receipts for food that should be fine.","2026-01-19T09:02:12.247Z"],["3818666","C2-275","C2","hendrik.vorno@bolt.eu","Hendrik Võrno","EMC-fixed controllers will ship out on {{2026-01-20}} via economy air. ETA to Tallinn ~20 days.","2026-01-19T09:02:23.898Z"],["3818667","PFI-834477","PFI","karl.kutsar@bolt.eu","Karl Kristjan Kutsar","Hey Valeria, it’s very likely that the driver swiped through driving statuses (or less likely, an app/lag issue). Changing to the next status right after “Driving with client“ translates as a rejected ride. This is for cases where the rider doesn’t show up, or the driver decides not to accept the rider.\nTherefore, by the inputs in-app, we have no proof that the trip actually happened. We can see however, that the next [order|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/2336900577/1?orderTryId=3003212071] was matched and started from the location where the previous one should’ve ended. So yes, logically we can pretend the trip happened, but we have no solid proof in our system, so I’d rather not compensate for this ride.\n\nIf the driver insists that they did not _accidentally_ swipe through the statuses, then this seems like an app issue, and tech-support might be able to help with this.\nLet me know if you have any more questions regarding this 🙂 ","2026-01-19T09:02:26.668Z"],["3818668","PC-4759","PC","siarhei.hlasouski@bolt.eu","Siarhei Hlasouski","Suggested approach Ledger do this in their own.\nI will mark the current task as done.","2026-01-19T09:02:42.887Z"],["3818670","LSS-61755","LSS","gabriele.kaveckyte@bolt.eu","Gabrielė Kaveckytė","Flagged to the Project team here: [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09LDRU2TMY/p1768813382394819|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09LDRU2TMY/p1768813382394819]","2026-01-19T09:03:17.001Z"],["3818671","DBRE-8599","DBRE","sangsun.bae@bolt.eu","Sangsun Bae","* Downscale replicas\n* [https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/15443|https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/15443]","2026-01-19T09:03:17.155Z"],["3818672","BP-13466","BP","abhishek.gupta@bolt.eu","Abhishek Gupta","Hey team, could you assist us with updating the SMS that's sent when a new user is added to a company by shortening the URL using our own URL shortener?\nThank you! :pray:\ncc: *@user-U08BAMM7X51*","2026-01-19T09:03:19.687Z"],["3818673","BP-13466","BP",null,"Slack","[Abhishek Gupta|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/634684f353df3c0123201010] synced this conversation thread with the Slack thread [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01CXE6RFK4/p1768473447881159?thread_ts=1768473447.881159&cid=C01CXE6RFK4|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01CXE6RFK4/p1768473447881159?thread_ts=1768473447.881159&cid=C01CXE6RFK4|smart-link]. Replies in synced threads will automatically update across both Slack and Jira.","2026-01-19T09:03:20.693Z"],["3818674","BP-13466","BP","shubham.sureka@bolt.eu","Shubham Sureka","[@fahad.khan|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/60f2a71d2f97d5006920d615] can you look into this?","2026-01-19T09:03:21.936Z"],["3818675","BP-13466","BP","fahad.khan@bolt.eu","Fahad Ahmed Khan","Is this SMS sent by LCM?","2026-01-19T09:03:22.764Z"],["3818676","BP-13466","BP","fahad.khan@bolt.eu","Fahad Ahmed Khan","Or by us? :thinking_face:","2026-01-19T09:03:23.390Z"],["3818677","BP-13466","BP","shubham.sureka@bolt.eu","Shubham Sureka","By engg is what i know","2026-01-19T09:03:23.935Z"],["3818678","BP-13466","BP","fahad.khan@bolt.eu","Fahad Ahmed Khan","[@abhishek.gupta|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/634684f353df3c0123201010] can you take a look pls?","2026-01-19T09:03:24.554Z"],["3818679","BP-13466","BP","karl.maasen@bolt.eu","Karl Maasen","Nope, it's coming from backend/adminpanel. Triggered immediately when a new user is added to a company.","2026-01-19T09:03:25.606Z"],["3818680","BP-13466","BP","abhishek.gupta@bolt.eu","Abhishek Gupta","[@mammad.imanov|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/5db2cd1c72d6f20c33d19e79] Since you talked to Web team recently about integrating url shortner, Do we need to talk with them before integrating it for this usecase as well? Also please correct me, but we still need to wait for some internal api created on url-shortner service first right?","2026-01-19T09:03:26.666Z"],["3818681","BP-13466","BP","fahad.khan@bolt.eu","Fahad Ahmed Khan","[@abhishek.gupta|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/634684f353df3c0123201010] but these links are hardcoded. Why do we need integration with URL shortener?","2026-01-19T09:03:27.560Z"],["3818682","BP-13466","BP","mammad.imanov@bolt.eu","Mammad Imanov","{quote}Marketing Tools {quote}\n\n{quote}URL Shortener and then create one. As <@U02CLF7A0CX{quote}\n\nWe don't need to have any API or something for this. Just need to go to Admin Panel > mentioned these links are hardcoded, once these links are created we can use it in SMS. Integration with internal API is needed when we have something dynamic. But here the link is just a deeplink that opens the app","2026-01-19T09:03:28.292Z"],["3818683","BP-13466","BP","abhishek.gupta@bolt.eu","Abhishek Gupta","Ah yes, it is not needed. I misunderstood it, sorry. I'll take care of the rest, thanks guys","2026-01-19T09:03:28.849Z"],["3818684","BP-13466","BP","shubham.sureka@bolt.eu","Shubham Sureka","Would love to get an timeline for this, also I am assuming this is not the only SMS with a link, are we changing them all?","2026-01-19T09:03:29.438Z"],["3818685","BP-13466","BP","abhishek.gupta@bolt.eu","Abhishek Gupta","Probably yes. Let me get back about which ones. \nAbout timeline, we should be able to take this in the current sprint (ends 30th Jan)","2026-01-19T09:03:29.981Z"],["3818686","BP-13466","BP","shubham.sureka@bolt.eu","Shubham Sureka","Awesome, thanks!","2026-01-19T09:03:30.516Z"],["3818688","PFI-832266","PFI","monika.civrag@bolt.eu","Monika Čivrag","agent needed","2026-01-19T09:03:51.644Z"],["3818690","LSS-61415","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret","Hello [~accountid:6052892160d39e006f72f166], merci pour ton ticket. \n\nJ’ai fait des recherches, mais il n’existe pas de règle nationale prévoyant une dérogation d’âge spécifique pour les véhicules TPMR. La limite d’âge des véhicules taxis (et les éventuelles extensions pour les TPMR) est fixée au niveau local, par arrêtés préfectoraux. En pratique, certains départements accordent une extension pour les TPMR, mais uniquement si cela est explicitement prévu dans l’arrêté préfectoral applicable. À défaut, la limite standard s’applique. \n\nJe propose qu’on étudie cette question en deux temps: (1) résolution de la situation du chauffeur; (2) alignement et recherche pour des cas futurs.\n\n\n\n→ Est ce que tu pourrais me confirmer dans quel département est ce que ce chauffeur est rattaché?\n\n\n\nMerci !","2026-01-19T09:04:39.856Z"],["3818692","PFI-833319","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nI have checked with Cellulant and I can confirm the refund has been issued to the customer for 163 GHS on 10/01/2026, 20:20:01UTC. \n\nThe payment state in Admin has been corrected. \n\nCheers, \nMarten\n\n","2026-01-19T09:05:36.045Z"],["3818694","PFI-831257","PFI","dan.nicolaev@bolt-outsource.eu","Dan Nicolaev","no assistance required here\n","2026-01-19T09:06:59.723Z"],["3818695","PFI-831607","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nWe have checked with EveryPay and can confirm the payment has been successful, but Bolt received a notification that the payment failed. \n\nWe have now corrected the payment state in Admin and the user received a BB refund of 3.8 EUR. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-19T09:07:01.161Z"],["3818696","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","Hey!  *group-S09DFNYN02E*\n\nSeems GMV missing (partly available) since 17th Jan.\nHourly split from 17th Jan below. Source[ here |https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/cross_domain/metrics_by_region__rides?qid=sWbqwqPD3wm7wnC9h6yl9j&origin_space=8850&toggle=vis]\n\nCould you please support\n\ncc *@user-UQVNNKG8H*, *@user-U02T64GMTA4* *@user-U0987EXBZPZ*","2026-01-19T09:07:01.830Z"],["3818697","DAEN-1346","DAEN",null,"Slack","[Yuriy Trofymenko|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/712020:ea34e25e-5aed-4ec5-8c46-0238dbead6e3] synced this conversation thread with the Slack thread [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09BSV4UVD3/p1768807784343689?thread_ts=1768807784.343689&cid=C09BSV4UVD3|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09BSV4UVD3/p1768807784343689?thread_ts=1768807784.343689&cid=C09BSV4UVD3|smart-link]. Replies in synced threads will automatically update across both Slack and Jira.","2026-01-19T09:07:02.942Z"],["3818698","DAEN-1346","DAEN","bartosz.janota@bolt.eu","Bartosz Janota","*group-S06EESBBYSY* *group-S05FGH5B82W* please take a look if we can help ","2026-01-19T09:07:03.891Z"],["3818699","DAEN-1346","DAEN","bartosz.janota@bolt.eu","Bartosz Janota","Do we have any infra issues or it's business logic?","2026-01-19T09:07:04.817Z"],["3818700","LSS-61606","LSS","beatrice.krasenko@bolt.eu","Beatričė Krašenko","hey, 7 working days, which would be this Friday. \n\n\n\n“I’m happy to help draft the text for this notification.”  - would appreciate that, just let me know and I’ll send them the email ","2026-01-19T09:07:05.062Z"],["3818701","DAEN-1346","DAEN","bartosz.janota@bolt.eu","Bartosz Janota","*group-S06DTJJN2HK* ptal as well ","2026-01-19T09:07:05.419Z"],["3818702","DAEN-1346","DAEN","bartosz.janota@bolt.eu","Bartosz Janota","Any updates?","2026-01-19T09:07:06.406Z"],["3818703","DAEN-1346","DAEN","siddhant.saxena@bolt.eu","Siddhant Saxena","*group-S0A8NMPKQ1Z*","2026-01-19T09:07:07.982Z"],["3818704","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","hi, sry, was commuting, investigating now","2026-01-19T09:07:08.979Z"],["3818707","WEBSD-1471","WEBSD","liivika.tamm@bolt.eu","Liivika Tamm","Hi team! \n\nPlease cancel the upload as the team has decided not to proceed with the campaign. Apologies for the confusion!\n\nThank you!","2026-01-19T09:07:35.287Z"],["3818710","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","Here’s the [definition|https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/4a346474e418f353ec44d093401a0b9839b2776f/rides/models/metrics/marketplace/monetary/rides_gmv_before_discounts.yml#L205]\n\nand it depends on \n\n* {{rides_price_before_discounts_eur_local}}\n* {{rides_cancellation_fees_before_discounts_eur_local}}\n* {{rides_no_show_fees_before_discounts_eur_local}}","2026-01-19T09:08:13.990Z"],["3818711","PFI-834134","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThe users payment has failed. \nThe customer payments team has released the payment and corrected the payment state in Admin. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-19T09:08:17.746Z"],["3818713","DRX-23548","DRX","ios.ci.robot@bolt.eu","ios.ci robot","2QA: nothing to test ","2026-01-19T09:08:49.037Z"],["3818717","PFI-834527","PFI","karl.kutsar@bolt.eu","Karl Kristjan Kutsar","Hey Patinya, checked the orders and you’re correct. These are very likely false-positive fraud flags, and you may compensate the driver for the lost bonus. Thanks!","2026-01-19T09:09:44.907Z"],["3818723","LSS-61716","LSS","triin.soonkoster@bolt.eu","Triin Soon-Köster","Hi again, MIB has confirmed that they accept the changes. Please proceed with the signing of BORL.","2026-01-19T09:09:57.675Z"],["3818725","PLUS-20","PLUS","artem.markov@bolt.eu","Artem Markov","Code looks ok out of the box. Need to test to see if it works in reality ","2026-01-19T09:10:13.694Z"],["3818727","LSS-57553","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret","Signed NDA shared here for future use: \n\n[^Non-Disclosure Agreement (Mutual)_Bolt Operations OU_Rounded Technologies SAS_30.10.2025.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-19T09:10:35.900Z"],["3818730","LSS-61606","LSS","beatrice.grize@bolt.eu","Beatričė Grižė","[~accountid:60acb13f1155bb006fce252c] sure, the email could be something like this:\n\nLaba diena,\n\nPatvirtiname, kad gavome Jūsų pateiktą pretenziją.\n\nNorime informuoti, kad šiuo metu „Bolt“ komanda nagrinėja pateiktą informaciją. Atsižvelgiant į pretenzijos apimtį ir turinį, informuojame, kad atsakymą galėsime pateikti ne anksčiau kaip iki 2026 m. sausio 30 d.\n\nApie tolimesnę eigą informuosime papildomai.\n\nPagarbiai\n„Bolt“ komanda","2026-01-19T09:11:52.612Z"],["3818733","LSS-61746","LSS","tatsiana.sivukha@bolt.eu","Tatsiana Sivukha","Hi [~accountid:5e592fc129e6d00c9707e3b5] \n\nCan you please ask the CSPC members to support the request?","2026-01-19T09:12:10.274Z"],["3818735","PFI-831583","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nWe have issued a refund for the customer and corrected the payment state. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-19T09:12:17.727Z"],["3818736","LSS-51490","LSS","joyanne.njau@bolt.eu","Joyanne Njau","Hey [~accountid:712020:b2a2738f-c1f1-447c-9b72-29851b5fed3e] please assign to [~accountid:712020:3d29a498-3ef1-4867-a3ad-7aeb77a221e9] who is currently handing this task.","2026-01-19T09:12:37.716Z"],["3818737","LSS-61746","LSS","ema.mlynarcikova@bolt.eu","Ema Mlynarcikova","Hey [~accountid:641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d] for now, Driver / Courier accounts are handled by Privacy.","2026-01-19T09:12:40.373Z"],["3818738","LSS-61096","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","hi [~accountid:712020:52cfdad6-7e7c-4e24-b869-dd2ab87c9432] please support with signing of the order today [^Articulate Amendment - ART-1241128 (2) (14cbdb4a-a475-44f5-9d91-93514e6388ba).pdf] ","2026-01-19T09:13:09.190Z"],["3818741","PFI-811415","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThe customers payment has failed. \nThe payments team has corrected the user payment. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-19T09:13:27.758Z"],["3818743","PFI-834041","PFI","andrezza.demarchi@bolt.eu","Andrezza Perfetto Demarchi","The bank account was already updated, could you please review? Thanks!!","2026-01-19T09:13:30.157Z"],["3818744","RDXENG-4562","RDXENG","evamaria.pedosk@bolt.eu","Eva-Maria Pedosk","[~accountid:712020:23b54a2f-1913-42e1-9019-8b2c32303d27] *Tested on CA.194.0, screen titles still need updating* (x) ","2026-01-19T09:13:51.497Z"],["3818745","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","Seems that all the components are missing entirely or partially from 17th, so I assume probably they are coming from the same table\n\n!image-20260119-091327.png|width=902,alt=\"image-20260119-091327.png\"!","2026-01-19T09:13:58.706Z"],["3818746","L10N-28512","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-28505](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28505)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-19T09:14:07.875Z"],["3818747","L10N-28513","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-28505](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28505)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-19T09:14:08.061Z"],["3818748","L10N-28519","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\