026-01-19T09:15:11.843Z"],["3818777","LSS-61537","LSS","eimantas.balciunas@bolt.eu","Eimantas Balčiūnas","[~accountid:712020:52cfdad6-7e7c-4e24-b869-dd2ab87c9432]  please cancel this ticket as client decided to buy with other company.","2026-01-19T09:15:15.161Z"],["3818779","PFI-833045","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! The driver doesn’t have any deductions made though? Does he mean commission…? Commission is a standard deduction that’s part of their T/C-s. ","2026-01-19T09:15:32.859Z"],["3818780","LSS-51524","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","Hey [~accountid:712020:822a759a-daf0-4161-afbf-8b79a2985fba] - thank you🙌 \n\nI will be looking at the response tomorrow first part of the day. \n\nKind regards,","2026-01-19T09:15:37.977Z"],["3818781","PFI-833668","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThe customer payments team has manually captured the payment in the Fondy portal. \nThe payment state in Admin has also been corrected. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-19T09:15:41.003Z"],["3818784","LSS-60240","LSS","liivika.tamm@bolt.eu","Liivika Tamm","As the campaign has been cancelled, I’ll be closing the ticket here as well.\n\nShould it become relevant again in the future, feel free to reopen this.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-19T09:16:15.229Z"],["3818785","CLIENTAPP-38777","CLIENTAPP","ios.ci.robot@bolt.eu","ios.ci robot","UI tests execution has been completed. Test cycle created: \"https://taxify.atlassian.net/projects/CLIENTAPP?selectedItem=com.atlassian.plugins.atlassian-connect-plugin%3Acom.kanoah.test-manager__main-project-page#!/testPlayer/CLIENTAPP-R3002\"","2026-01-19T09:16:19.708Z"],["3818786","PFI-829143","PFI","natalia.beresneva@bolt.eu","Natalia Beresneva","The courier has already used the debt payment for a different account.","2026-01-19T09:16:26.418Z"],["3818787","LSS-61760","LSS","maarja-liis@bolt.eu","Maarja-Liis Reiman","[^Bolt Rides PL sp zoo Citi confirmation letter.pdf] _(285 kB)_","2026-01-19T09:16:27.395Z"],["3818789","LSS-61759","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Thanks for your ticket! For the lucky ones with access to Flank-supported channels (#legal-agent-) — why not ask your legal AI assistant first on Slack — Flank might already have the answer.","2026-01-19T09:16:29.669Z"],["3818797","PFI-833886","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! Where do you see those rides? ","2026-01-19T09:17:24.793Z"],["3818800","PFI-833685","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThe payment had gotten stuck with Fondy due to technical issues. \nThe customer payments team has manually captured the payment and corrected the Admin payment state. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-19T09:17:39.099Z"],["3818801","PRIV-461","PRIV","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","*Update:*\n\n# Alignment was reached confirming Bolt’s ability to re-use collected data for PayCo purposes.\n# A DSA amendment was prepared and sent for signature.\n# *Airwallex Legal had indicated they intend to propose further changes;* \n# Amendment & comments from AWX were received last week. Review is currently in progress.\n\nPrivacy will coordinate with [+Usman Nasir+|mailto:usman.nasir@bolt.eu] and the Commerce team once Airwallex’s feedback is received to agree on next steps.\n\n[^Amendment to the master service agreement DSA (AWX final 20260114)_clean.docx]\n\n","2026-01-19T09:17:51.527Z"],["3818802","LSS-61761","LSS","eimantas.balciunas@bolt.eu","Eimantas Balčiūnas","[^EE20260114-001 Rover SUD - Bolt Drive EE.docx.pdf] _(342 kB)_\n\n[^NEW Extrait RCS 29 02 2024.pdf] _(346 kB)_\n\n[^TVA Intracommunautaire (1).pdf] _(1.44 MB)_\n\n[^CI Myriam Muzzolini.pdf] _(124 kB)_","2026-01-19T09:17:53.583Z"],["3818803","PAW-18353","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 AI Analysis: Labels added automatically: pint-bucket-platform, pint-component-admin-panel, pint-product-admin-platform, pint-capability-platform-services\n\nIf you think the labels are incorrect, please remove the suggested labels and add the correct ones.","2026-01-19T09:17:55.663Z"],["3818806","LSS-61716","LSS","raivis.busmanis@bolt.eu","Raivis Bušmanis","Hi Legal Ops, please organize Ahto signature (SpotDraft digital signature) on the attached document. Thanks! [^Brokers' Appointment in WORD ( Not Sole)_final.docx] ","2026-01-19T09:18:07.671Z"],["3818807","LSS-54899","LSS","mahmoud.iskandarani@bolt.eu","Mahmoud Iskandarani","Osi left and he said that the bank did not accept the POA can we reopen the ticket please and maybe issue new POA to someone else or even hire a local lawfirm to help us close the accounts? Happy to take that to treasury cost center ","2026-01-19T09:18:12.509Z"],["3818808","PFI-834554","PFI","karl.kutsar@bolt.eu","Karl Kristjan Kutsar","Hey [~accountid:712020:e08f01ef-2849-432e-9ba1-dd2eb3b1ff44]  I just wanted to clarify the intended next step here. Would you like us to remove the hard block now, or are you planning to apply a scheduled block first and then have us lift the hard block so you can continue the investigation?\n\nLet me know which option you prefer so we proceed correctly.","2026-01-19T09:18:44.494Z"],["3818809","LSS-60566","LSS","joyanne.njau@bolt.eu","Joyanne Njau","Hello [~accountid:712020:a7a7d4bc-10ca-44a0-a22e-fa8752330abd], please assign this to [~accountid:712020:3d29a498-3ef1-4867-a3ad-7aeb77a221e9], who is now handling DSARs and access requests.","2026-01-19T09:18:47.675Z"],["3818811","LSS-61763","LSS","eimantas.balciunas@bolt.eu","Eimantas Balčiūnas","[^LV20260114-001 Rover SUD - Bolt Drive LV.docx.pdf] _(336 kB)_\n\n[^NEW Extrait RCS 29 02 2024.pdf] _(346 kB)_\n\n[^TVA Intracommunautaire (1).pdf] _(1.44 MB)_\n\n[^CI Myriam Muzzolini.pdf] _(124 kB)_","2026-01-19T09:19:11.174Z"],["3818814","DSR-3241","DSR","estelle.herbiet@bolt.eu","Estelle Herbiet","Hi CSPC, answer letter reviewed (/)  and responsive data as well (/)  since the driver didn’t request all data associated to their account, I trimmed the responsive data down.\n\nPlease share the answer and data with the driver 🙏 ","2026-01-19T09:19:50.055Z"],["3818816","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","Components and the tables used for components\n\n* [rides_price_before_discounts_eur_local|https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/8db930a15928208c247334d085594ee2dd07ace2/rides/models/semantic_models/semantic_fact_rides_order_try.yml#L283C15-L283C53] - *fact_rides_order_try*\n* [rides_cancellation_fees_before_discounts_eur_local|https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/8db930a15928208c247334d085594ee2dd07ace2/rides/models/semantic_models/semantic_fact_rides_order_try.yml#L288] - *fact_rides_order_try*\n* [rides_no_show_fees_before_discounts_eur_local|https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/8db930a15928208c247334d085594ee2dd07ace2/rides/models/semantic_models/semantic_fact_rides_order_try.yml#L293] - *fact_rides_order_try*","2026-01-19T09:20:01.145Z"],["3818817","CRC-2250","CRC","hassan.farooq@bolt.eu","Hassan Farooq","[update] Reconciliation framework improvement in progress due to limited scalability. New reconciliations Ledger vs Ledger aggr & Ledger aggr euro vs Pigment aggr in progress as well.","2026-01-19T09:20:05.951Z"],["3818819","WD-21923","WD","marko.hulak@bolt.eu","Marko Hulak","[~accountid:712020:66d8f4d5-ef7d-4df5-ad8d-55b91c398d6c] please check what I did in your absence. Ticket should be considered completed. I’m reassigning it to you so you can close it once you finish up reading on it 🙂 ","2026-01-19T09:20:13.028Z"],["3818821","BDB-1500","BDB","jevgeni.trombovetski@bolt.eu","Jevgeni Trombovetski","[~accountid:6290ab2fab91fe00709a0d7c] Hey! Could you please provide the following info for motion:\n\n- Duration of the spot\n- File formats they accept (mp4, mov, etc)\n\nThank you","2026-01-19T09:20:49.497Z"],["3818822","CSDA-282","CSDA","mariia.cherezova@bolt.eu","Mariia Cherezova","cc [~accountid:712020:b7dbdf89-bae4-441f-a434-d34b3d80b830] ","2026-01-19T09:20:51.769Z"],["3818824","DESIGN-197","DESIGN","benjamin.otting@bolt.eu","Benni Otting","Get extra context from Maido ","2026-01-19T09:21:07.008Z"],["3818825","DSR-3241","DSR","estelle.herbiet@bolt.eu","Estelle Herbiet","[~accountid:712020:d008dcec-6cfe-47e4-83a0-c29522744742] - FYI, driver submitted a pre-litigation notice 👩‍⚖️  the _mise en demeure_ is attached to this ticket.","2026-01-19T09:21:09.576Z"],["3818826","PFI-834258","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThe payment failed because the user did not complete the ApplePay authentication in the required time period which caused the payment request to expire. Kindly advise the user to retry and complete the authentication or use a different card in their ApplePay wallet.","2026-01-19T09:21:23.124Z"],["3818832","BD-1994","BD",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nDelivery ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1961738486\n","2026-01-19T09:22:17.612Z"],["3818834","EBIKE1-27","EBIKE1","klemet-gustav.tamm@bolt.eu","Klemet-Gustav Tamm","[~accountid:624b3bdf8678e900705d9004] I think we can","2026-01-19T09:22:31.564Z"],["3818836","PFI-835316","PFI","bruno.pereira@bolt.eu","Bruno dos Reis Pereira","[^2025-12-15 -- 2025-12-22 Abu Muhammad Nazmul Haque Weekly Report (1).pdf]","2026-01-19T09:22:40.295Z"],["3818837","PFI-834078","PFI","aida.nikunlassi@bolt-outsource.eu","Aida Nikunlassi","Information was on KB","2026-01-19T09:22:41.488Z"],["3818838","PFI-835316","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nDelivery ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1961738486\n","2026-01-19T09:22:42.375Z"],["3818843","DAEN-1346","DAEN","bartosz.janota@bolt.eu","Bartosz Janota","[@yuriy.trofymenko|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/712020:ea34e25e-5aed-4ec5-8c46-0238dbead6e3] np, I see you are investigating in the JIRA ticket. Do you have any first guesses what happened?","2026-01-19T09:23:35.529Z"],["3818846","DELIVERY-191","DELIVERY","varvara.kazakova@bolt.eu","Varvara Kazakova","26W4: Waiting for animation","2026-01-19T09:24:09.632Z"],["3818850","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","Being used in [this workflow|https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/main/rides/workflows/dbt__rides__core_24h.py#L15] and this workflow is executed by [this DAG|https://airflow-common.data.boltint.net/dags/dbt__all_core_models__24h_03/grid?search=dbt__all_core_models__24h_03] and the DAG had no recent failures, looking to logs","2026-01-19T09:24:29.177Z"],["3818853","LSS-61752","LSS","beatriz.leiva@bolt.eu","Beatriz Leiva","Hi [~accountid:712020:dc5a9fc0-ec62-423d-a2f8-435f02007669],\n\nThanks for reaching out.\n\nWe would prefer to use our standard lease agreement template rather than the landlord’s. Could you please help push for the use of our template with the landlord?\n\nMany thanks!","2026-01-19T09:24:38.603Z"],["3818854","SREDESK-7432","SREDESK","sergiu.costea@bolt.eu","Sergiu Costea","[~accountid:5a5c67a50a353741d0fe791e] FYI","2026-01-19T09:24:40.220Z"],["3818856","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","so far no alerts happened, now jumping into the dag logs\n\n*Attachments*\n\n* [https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A93CBMJ0P/image.png|https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A93CBMJ0P/image.png|smart-link]","2026-01-19T09:24:54.962Z"],["3818857","LSS-61749","LSS","alexandra.mitroi@bolt.eu","Alexandra-Mihaela Mitroi","hi [~accountid:712020:01605863-b8a5-452e-be42-1637a912db2b] , please find [here|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqlKjlNjN0xYAJCNc-UlQbRIStvPNNBKui9vAH1yRJg/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.f3gs7sy329z7] the draft of the answer, as prepared by [~accountid:712020:8c797c70-7a57-496e-aa3f-5d91df806eb2] and further agreed by you, within which I have added the Romanian version as well.\n\n[~accountid:712020:52cfdad6-7e7c-4e24-b869-dd2ab87c9432] , please obtain Ahto’s signature on the document, following for it to be applied in both language versions (RO and EN), both wet ink and electronic signature is fine. The request is urgent!\n\nThanks so much,\n\nAlex","2026-01-19T09:24:57.223Z"],["3818858","PFI-834277","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nChecking the transaction history page, the overcharge was taken out of the customer’s Bolt balance as a debt [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/user-balance/trxHistory?filter={\"offset\"%3Anull%2C\"filter\"%3A{\"target_account_id\"%3A69679008}}&tz=Europe%2FTallinn|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/user-balance/trxHistory?filter=%7B%22offset%22%3Anull%2C%22filter%22%3A%7B%22target_account_id%22%3A69679008%7D%7D&tz=Europe%2FTallinn]. But the refund that was made to the user was to their payment method (card) and not the Bolt balance. The user will still need to pay the debt on their next order as they have already been refund to the card for the debt amount.","2026-01-19T09:25:06.707Z"],["3818865","LSS-61765","LSS","eleanora.maruma@bolt.eu","Eleanora Maruma","[^doc02194620260119144818.pdf] _(836 kB)_","2026-01-19T09:25:47.132Z"],["3818868","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","very guessy idea I have as of now is that mb sources didn't arrive or smth with the model config, or it hit overflow on databricks side but somehow this didn't get recognized as an error state by airflow","2026-01-19T09:26:08.790Z"],["3818869","LSS-60663","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","Thank you [~accountid:6096595a33a941007116501b]. \n\nTo clarify, the request to the privacy team is to confirm that the collaboration model does not raise any privacy concerns, correct?\n\nTo assist with this, I need to clarify the missing information in the flowchart. Specifically:\n\n# Data/documents storage: Can you provide the exact list of third parties that will store the data? Is this the same as with the Op Co entity, or are you planning different locations/partners for PayCo?\n# Do you have a complete list of third parties involved in onboarding for each processing activity (e.g., storage, AML, event collection for conversion analytics)? I understand the key ones (Veritas, AWX, Veriff) but would like a comprehensive list, if possible.\n\n{panel:bgColor=#deebff}\nIf you can promptly provide this information, I will aim to review and respond by the end of the week.\n{panel}","2026-01-19T09:26:12.294Z"],["3818870","SREDESK-7432","SREDESK","asko.tamm@bolt.eu","Asko Tamm","Shahriar can take a look at this this week ","2026-01-19T09:26:17.573Z"],["3818871","LSS-61122","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hei, [~accountid:712020:a729743a-fea5-401d-a417-a7025bd4ee5a] ! Please find the signed document(s) attached.[^Cooperation agreement_Bolt Operations OÜ_Demir Taxibetrieb GmbH_08.12.25.pdf] ","2026-01-19T09:26:20.739Z"],["3818873","DSR-3811","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-19T09:26:27.200Z"],["3818874","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","but usually from my experience sources are not the issue, so I so far doubt it would be on dap side","2026-01-19T09:26:35.569Z"],["3818875","DELIVERY-1114","DELIVERY","varvara.kazakova@bolt.eu","Varvara Kazakova","26W4: Design Critique done. In progress: recent searches UX improvements, fundamental structure proposal","2026-01-19T09:26:38.029Z"],["3818877","HS-29049","HS","kristi.vahl@bolt.eu","Kristi Liina Vahl","Waiting info from manager if she is actually back to work.","2026-01-19T09:27:15.787Z"],["3818878","LSS-60438","LSS","rachel.sallnow@bolt.eu","Rachel Sallnow","Hi [~accountid:712020:1d6c93be-7e37-4cdc-a9ef-de0c2a57f2b3] Please let me know if you need anything further on this NDA.  Otherwise, I will close the ticket. Thanks","2026-01-19T09:27:16.683Z"],["3818879","LSS-61752","LSS","beatriz.leiva@bolt.eu","Beatriz Leiva","Link to the jurisdiction agnostic template: [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mzB1pywp2jropdsooDSLQrR9d5Z7Hy8ER_ECyO9sN-Q/template/preview|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mzB1pywp2jropdsooDSLQrR9d5Z7Hy8ER_ECyO9sN-Q/template/preview|smart-link]  ","2026-01-19T09:27:22.104Z"],["3818880","LSS-58949","LSS","ema.mlynarcikova@bolt.eu","Ema Mlynarcikova","Hey [~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] thanks for sharing. I took a look.\n\n\n\nCognizant’s point doesn’t sound unreasonable. Their concern relates to joint & several liability to Data Subjects (Article 82 GDPR) where if Congizant pays EUR 10m to Data Subjects because of Bolt’s failure, Clause 15.6 caps Bolt’s reimbursement at EUR 1m → Cognizant eats the rest.\n\n\n\nThe proposed wording also carves out only situations where Cognizant pays for Bolt’s non-compliance → then liability cap = paid fees over last 12 months. \n\n\n\nIn my opinion, we can accept the proposed wording. ✅ \n\n\n\n [~accountid:641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d] – what do you think?","2026-01-19T09:27:28.369Z"],["3818881","RDXENG-4722","RDXENG","sergei.emelianov@bolt.eu","Sergey Emeliyanov","Backend was released, not necessary anymore","2026-01-19T09:27:38.447Z"],["3818882","PLUS-49","PLUS","artem.markov@bolt.eu","Artem Markov","Also looks ok according to the code. Need to test on device or emulator","2026-01-19T09:27:40.925Z"],["3818883","PFI-834288","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThere is no debt on the account preventing the customer from closing their account. There must have been a blockage when the payment booking was still in process but currently the booking has been cancelled.","2026-01-19T09:28:01.370Z"],["3818885","LSS-59762","LSS","dolinda.mbensa@bolt.eu","Dolinda Mbensa","Good day,\n\nThe lawyer has reverted\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 11.27.49.png|width=927,height=332,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 11.27.49.png\"!\n\n\n\n\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 11.27.40.png|width=938,height=481,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 11.27.40.png\"!\n\n","2026-01-19T09:28:05.628Z"],["3818886","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","!image-20260119-092809.png|width=902,alt=\"image-20260119-092809.png\"!","2026-01-19T09:28:11.963Z"],["3818887","MVRT-1447","MVRT","sohniya.nair@bolt.eu","Sohniya Nair","Update: [~accountid:6131fd9fdae0a20071ad22a3] will schedule a kick off meeting this week with [~accountid:712020:482e0860-d974-41c5-b7c0-5f29d6d85a90] and [~accountid:60ab71565dc18500701cae80] to discuss media plan and timelines.\n\ncc: [~accountid:5d289a7c3e09b40c262cfaa9] ","2026-01-19T09:28:28.566Z"],["3818888","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","ok, found where the problem is definitely in that first failed attempt then succeeded, but now looking into specifics\n\n*Attachments*\n\n* [https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A9CEYSGKV/image.png|https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A9CEYSGKV/image.png|smart-link]","2026-01-19T09:28:37.726Z"],["3818889","LSS-51490","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","Hey [~accountid:712020:da839b78-87fc-4471-947b-3aae59c6030b] - I tried multiple times, including after refreshing Jira. For some reason, I cannot assign it to Oliver, but can assign to everyone else.\n\nPerhaps there is an issue with the Jira access for him - can you please check?","2026-01-19T09:28:53.784Z"],["3818890","L10N-28582","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-28581](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28581)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-19T09:28:55.816Z"],["3818891","L10N-28583","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-28581](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-28581)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-1