taxify.atlassian.net/browse/RNTL-30429|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/RNTL-30429|smart-link] ","2026-01-19T09:46:33.022Z"],["3819049","PFI-834307","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis payment failed and there was no charge placed on the customer’s payment method. The only charge with that amount on the same day came from this payment [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/4024376064|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/4024376064]. I would advise the user to check with their Mobile Network Operator about this charge.","2026-01-19T09:46:33.597Z"],["3819050","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","order key should be coming from fact_rides_order","2026-01-19T09:46:36.328Z"],["3819051","PFI-835342","PFI","victoria.akinfenwa@bolt-outsource.eu","Victoria Akinfenwa","!513c1ce4-7753-4b87-825e-95edc9d51c61 ME.jpeg|thumbnail!","2026-01-19T09:46:36.321Z"],["3819053","LSS-59055","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret","Hi [~accountid:5f5f26b5f4571b006a51732b] , apologies, this is my mistake. I had only attached the previous ticket for my own reference to review the new ticket in light of it, but I acknowledge that I have attached those tickets without providing any context. ","2026-01-19T09:46:45.435Z"],["3819054","DAEN-1346","DAEN","yuriy.trofymenko@bolt.eu","Yuriy Trofymenko","and smth was merged here 3 days ago\n\n*Attachments*\n\n* [https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A9K045UUS/image.png|https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A9K045UUS/image.png|smart-link]","2026-01-19T09:47:01.202Z"],["3819056","CLIENTAPP-38777","CLIENTAPP","ios.ci.robot@bolt.eu","ios.ci robot","UI tests execution has been completed. Test cycle created: \"https://taxify.atlassian.net/projects/CLIENTAPP?selectedItem=com.atlassian.plugins.atlassian-connect-plugin%3Acom.kanoah.test-manager__main-project-page#!/testPlayer/CLIENTAPP-R3008\"","2026-01-19T09:47:07.9