 Fraud related issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/58/create/317\n- App and backend issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/76\n- Balance and Invoices issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/58/create/318\n- Invoice Fiscalization (e.g. Missing QR, SAF-T) issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247\n- Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301\n\nCheers\nCommerce Team Jira Bot","2026-01-19T11:28:02.615Z"],["3819833","PFI-834555","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThe payment capture has now been successfully sent out again and once completed, the debt will be cleared. If the customer has already paid for the pending payment on their next order, they will be refunded back to the Bolt balance. If the user is unhappy with the Bolt balance refund, kindly check with your team how to help compensate the user, keeping in mind that refunding the user back to their payment method will not cancel the balance refund, meaning they will be refunded twice.","2026-01-19T11:28:16.506Z"],["3819840","LSS-59767","LSS","oluwatosin.ogunsanwo@bolt.eu","Oluwatosin Ogunsanwo","Hello [~accountid:712020:8fd75aa8-dcfb-42ad-93ab-53900ee4c301] \n\nThanks for the reply. I was out sick last week and just resumed today. Since most of the information was taken from our public Confluence pages, I don’t believe there’s anything sensitive in the document. Please let me know whether I should sign it or have it sent to you for signing.","2026-01-19T11:29:21.263Z"],["3819847","WFM-10036","WFM","ramone.edwards@bolt.eu","Ramone Edwards","and this one [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/725697663|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/725697663]","2026-01-19T11:30:05.501Z"],["3819850","P