ed.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.685Z"],["3820971","L10N-28451","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.731Z"],["3820972","L10N-28477","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.787Z"],["3820973","L10N-28468","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.794Z"],["3820974","L10N-28453","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.925Z"],["3820975","L10N-28461","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.972Z"],["3820976","L10N-28459","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:01.971Z"],["3820977","L10N-28449","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.037Z"],["3820978","L10N-28447","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.056Z"],["3820979","L10N-28460","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.081Z"],["3820980","L10N-28466","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.089Z"],["3820981","L10N-28450","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.114Z"],["3820982","L10N-28446","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.363Z"],["3820983","L10N-28452","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:02.379Z"],["3820984","L10N-28454","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:03.778Z"],["3820985","L10N-28456","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-19T14:14:04.990Z"],["3820986","LSS-51490","LSS","oliver.chinyere@bolt.eu","Oliver Chinyere","[~accountid:712020:b2a2738f-c1f1-447c-9b72-29851b5fed3e] based on the email history, your message on 23 December regarding the date of rollout *has not been confirmed* with the local DPO, so no action has been taken.\n\nDPO advised:   \n\n# We conduct a DPIA for this particular rollout. If it has already been done, kindly share it.\n# Notify the regulator, POTRAZ via a letter which makes specific reference to the DPIA along with the details of the Driver Selfie Verification function and the associated benefits and risk mitigators. If possible, it would also be good to attach the DPIA I mentioned before.\n\nThere is no mention of this task in Eliise’s handover. Please provide the DPIA for this feature (I see this in [Google Drive|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NiVXQm8WoDAXXnwIcFoMgE2PmXcOuux-/edit#bookmark=id.gjdgxs] but there may be a newer version) which we can share so DPO representative can draft the letter addressing risk factors/mitigation as detailed in DPIA.","2026-01-19T14:14:07.822Z"],["3820988","PFI-823593","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThe payment capture has now been successfully sent out again and once completed, the debt will be cleared. If the customer has already paid for the pending payment on their next order, they will be refunded back to the Bolt balance. If the user is unhappy with the Bolt balance refund, kindly check with your team how to help compensate the user, keeping in mind that refunding the user back to their payment method will not cancel the balance refund, meaning they will be refunded twice.","2026-01-19T14:14:23.386Z"],["3820990","PAW-14993","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 AI Analysis: Labels added automatically: pint-bucket-platform, pint-component-njsc-db, pint-product-backend-platform, pint-capability-platform-services\n\nIf you think the labels are incorrect, please remove the suggested labels and add the correct ones.","2026-01-19T14:14:27.671Z"],["3820993","PC-4924","PC","parth.patel@bolt.eu","Parth Patel","[~accountid:6096595a33a941007116501b] Would you need anything here from me? cc [~accountid:618265cc3e3753006f82d870] ","2026-01-19T14:15:04.599Z"],["3820999","BD-1968","BD","alexander.embacher@bolt.eu","Alexander Embacher","Credit & Reissue Business <> Delivery Records Differences\n\n!Credit & Reissue Business __ Delivery Records Differences.png|width=1308,alt=\"Credit & Reissue Business <> Delivery Records Differences.png\"!","2026-01-19T14:16:32.418Z"],["3821000","PFI-824192","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:16:39.455Z"],["3821001","PFI-824460","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:17:08.906Z"],["3821004","SUPX-2317","SUPX","artem.kudlaienko@bolt.eu","Artem Kudlaienko","Resolved in [PR|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/160917]","2026-01-19T14:17:26.339Z"],["3821006","PFI-824622","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:17:30.200Z"],["3821007","PASD-173","PASD","george.matu@bolt.eu","George Matu","Output: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FmqYm8x5v7f5R3IWT11NRIgt0IM5ztiHD2VZGqqt3I8/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.kv3k8noamf9u","2026-01-19T14:17:44.219Z"],["3821010","PFI-824951","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly 