getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:19:21.673Z"],["3821020","PFI-827885","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:19:57.546Z"],["3821021","PFI-828207","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:20:27.772Z"],["3821022","CSDT-969","CSDT","boris.pavlov@bolt.eu","Boris Pavlov","Formulas replaced in the scorecard:\n\n* Schedule Adherence - old explores ✅ \n* Process adherence - old explores  ✅ \n* Reopen rate - new explores, mart ✅ \n* Utilisation - old explores ✅ \n* Occupancy - old explores ✅ \n* Cost per ticket - new explores, mart ✅ \n* CS Cost as % of GMV - new explores, mart ✅ \n* Average handled cases per hour - TBA ❌ blocked by agent mart\n* Average handling time per case - new explores, mart ✅ \n* CSAT (Global) - new explores, mart ✅ \n* CSAT (Chaffeur) - new explores, mart ✅ \n* SLO Conformity Live: Under 30 Seconds - old explores ✅ \n* SLO Conformity non-Live: Under 6 Hours - old explores ✅ \n* First contact resolution rate - manual calculation in the sheet ❌ automation blocked because of lack of alignment\n* Overall T1 resolution rate - new explores, mart, but needs a fix first ❌\n* Refunds & Compensations - new explores, mart ✅ \n* Refunds & Compensations as % of GMV - new explores, mart ✅ \n* Support requests per order (CCPO) - new explores, mart ✅ \n* Safety cases per 10 k order - new explores, mart ✅ ","2026-01-19T14:20:29.860Z"],["3821025