"Access granted.","2026-01-19T14:26:37.950Z"],["3821065","PFI-830769","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:26:39.212Z"],["3821066","MM-917","MM","maksym.hayduk@bolt.eu","Maksym Haiduk","Rejected, we have hardcoded values for now. We need a proper action and discussion on this one.","2026-01-19T14:26:55.395Z"],["3821068","WFM-10043","WFM","marcin.porowski@bolt.eu","Marcin Porowski","Hello, it's done","2026-01-19T14:27:07.512Z"],["3821069","AIOT-509","AIOT","tarmo.kuuse@bolt.eu","Tarmo Kuuse","Report: [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1s9z-Pq1Oq_V3VSmu9tkIwz1eudiA1W0MlmYmDwaH4z0/edit?usp=sharing|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1s9z-Pq1Oq_V3VSmu9tkIwz1eudiA1W0MlmYmDwaH4z0/edit?usp=sharing]","2026-01-19T14:27:23.998Z"],["3821070","PFI-830966","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThis ticket will be closed due to not getting any new response from the reporter in the last 7 days. Kindly leave a comment if this case requires further assistance. We will be happy to help you!","2026-01-19T14:27:25.660Z"],["3821071","DO-5815","DO","kartikeya.sharma@bolt.eu","Kartikeya Sharma","done","2026-01-19T14:27:39.330Z"],["3821074","PFI-831598","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nDo need further assistance on this ticket or have any update regarding the last comment?","2026-01-19T14:28:14.667Z"],["3821077","PFI-831689","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nDo need further assistance on this ticket or have any update regarding the last comment?","2026-01-19T14:28:30.537Z"],["3821079","WFM-10044","WFM","marcin.porowski@bolt.eu","Marcin Porowski","Hello, it's done","2026-01-19T14:28:38.751Z"],["3821080","PFI-831766","PFI","afib