mented at this time.\n** Apparently Gab was involved in the original negotiation of the agreement. I have asked to see the SD ticket as evidence of this.\n** Josh does not know why: (a) Stage 1 data sharing was considered as “anonymous”; nor (b) why Stage 2 data sharing is not mentioned in the agreement. Nevertheless, he is confident that the list of Stage 2 data categories in the agreement is in fact complete.\n** Approximately 1200 German fleets will be involved in Stage 1 data sharing.\n* Key points that I made on the call:\n** We can proceed with both Stage 1 and Stage 2 data sharing, given the low risk profile. However Stage 2 is inherently riskier, since it concerns bank account information and is not covered in the agreement.\n** I